      "bibliographicCitation": "[1920/1925/1928]: Insel-Verlag, Leipzig\n\n''Baumeister der Welt. Versuch einer Typologie des Geistes. 3 vols. 1920-1928\n\nVol. 1. Drei Meister: Balzac - Dickens - Dostojewski. 219/(1)p. 1920\n\nContents:\n\nEinleitung, pp. 7-9\nBalzac, pp. (11)-50\nDickens, pp. (51)-87\nDostojewski, pp. (89)-(220)\n\n \nVol. 2. Der Kampf mit dem Dämon: Hölderlin - Heinrich von Kleist - Friedrich Nietzsche. 321/(3)p. 1925\n\nContents:\n\nEinleitung, pp. 7-(22)\nHölderlin, pp. (23)-151\nHeinrich von Kleist, pp. (153)-229\nFriedrich Nietzsche, pp. (231)-(322)\n\nVol. 3. Drei Dichter ihres Lebens: Casanova - Stendhal - Tolstoi. 377/(3)p. 1928\n\nContents:\n\nEinleitung, pp. 7-(22)\nCasanova, pp. (23)-122\nStendhal, pp. (123)-228\nTolstoi, pp. (229)-377\n\n[1936]: Reichner Verlag, Wien/Leipzig/Zürich \n\nBaumeister der Welt. 650/(1)p. The introductions in the three individual volumes above were omitted. Page (7) contains a new foreword\n\nContents:\n\nVorwort [Sommer 1935], p. (7)\n\nDrei Meister \n\nBalzac, pp. (9)-39\nDickens, pp. (41)-70 \nDostojewski, pp. (71)-169\n\nDer Kampf mit dem Dämon\n\nHölderlin, pp. (171)-263\nHeinrich von Kleist, pp. (265)-323\nFriedrich Nietzsche, pp. (325)-396\n\nDrei Dichter ihres Lebens\n\nCasanova, pp. (397)-463\nStendhal, pp. (465)-537\nTolstoi, pp. (539)-650\n \n\n[1951]: S. Fischer Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nBaumeister der Welt. 593/(1)p.\n\n*1st edition. 593/(1)p. 16,000 copies. 1951\n*2nd edition. 598/(1)p. 10,000 copies. 1952\n*3rd edition. 602/(2)p. 4,000 copies. 1958\n*4th edition. 602/(2)p. 4,000 copies. 1962\n\nSpecial edition:\n\n*1st edition. 602/(3)p. 24,000 copies. 1965\n*2nd edition. 602/(3)p. 25,000 copies. 1966\n\nContents:\n\nDrei Meister\n\nBalzac, pp. (7)-35\nDickens, pp. (37)-64\nDostojewski, pp. (65)-155\n\nDer Kampf mit dem Dämon\n\nHölderlin, pp. (159)-242\nHeinrich von Kleist, pp. (243)-296\nFriedrich Nietzsche, pp. (297)-362\n\nDrei Dichter ihres Lebens\n\nCasanova, pp. (363)-424\nStendhal, 