trated [Series. Menschen, die die Welt bewegten]\n\n\"Marie Antoinette\" , pp. (196)-(357)\n\nPortrait of Marie Antoinette, p. (196)\nText, pp. (197)-355\nZeittafel: Marie Antoinette, pp. (356)-(357)\n \n\n[1997]: Fischer Taschenbuch Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nMarie Antoinette. Bildnis eines mittleren Charakters * Maria Stuart. Cover by Buchholz, Hinsch & Hensinger. Cover portrait by Hardy Brackmann. 575/(1) & 469/(7)/(6)p. [Limitierte Sonderausgabe. FT 13546]\n\nLimited special edition. 24,000 copies. 1997\n\nContents:\n\nMarie Antoinette, pp. (5)-(576) [8 plates between pp. 288-289]\nMaria Stuart, pp. (5)-(470) [8 plates between pp. 196-197]\nBildnachweis, p. (473)\nInhalt, pp. (474)-(476)\n\n[2000]: S. Fischer Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nMarie Antoinette. Bildnis eines mmittleren Charakters. Special edition. Edited with an afterword by Knut Beck. 590/(1)p. Illustrated [Sammlung Fischer - die Bibliothek der klassischen Moderne]. Knut Beck. “Nachwort”, pp. (577)-(591)\n\n[2003]: Fischer Taschenbuch Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nMarie Antoinette. Bildnis eines mittleren Charakters. A limited special edition of 5,000 copies. Afterword by Knut Beck. 590/(1)p. Cover design by +malsy, Bremen. Zweig photograph: Archiv S. Fischer Verlag [Fischer Taschenbuch 50635]. “Nachbemerkung des Herausgebers” [Knut Beck], pp. (577)-(591)\n\n[2005]: Fischer Taschenbuch Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nMarie Antoinette. Bildnis eines mittleren Charakters. Afterword by Knut Beck. 6,000 copies. Illustrated. 590/(1)p. Cover design by Hauptmann & Kompanie, München. Cover photograph: Alexander Roslin. ‘Portrait der Baronin von Neubourg-Cromière’ [Detail] [Fischer Taschenbuch 50930]. Knut Beck. “Nachbemerkung des Herausgebers”, pp. (577)-(591)\n\n[2011]: Fischer Taschenbuch Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nMarie Antoinette. Bildnis eines mittleren Charakters. Edited with an afterword by Knut Beck. Cover illustration by Alexander Roslin. Detail from “Portrait der Baronin von Neubourg”. 541/(1)p. [F