      "bibliographicCitation": "[1985]: SKV-Edition, Lahr (Schwarzwald)\n\nAusgewählte Kostbarkeiten. Compiled with a foreword by Gottfried Berron. 63/(1)p. [Ausgewählte Kostbarkeiten, 92427]\n\n*1st edition 10,000 copies 1985\n*2nd edition 6,000 copies 1985\n*3rd edition 5,000 copies 1986\n*4th edition 5,000 copies 1987\n*5th edition 5,000 copies 1988\n*6th edition 5,000 copies 1989\n*7th edition 5,000 copies 1990\n*8th edition 6,000 copies 1991\n*9th edition 5,000 copies 1993\n*10th edition 5,000 copies 1993\n*11th edition 5,000 copies 1994\n*12th edition 5,000 copies 1996\n\nContents:\n\nForeword \n\nStefan Zweig [Gottfried Berron], pp. 3-8\n\nA collection of aphoristic statements garnered from Zweig's works [Fiction, dramas, historical studies, and correspondence] under the following headings\n\nSchaffen und gestalten, pp. 9-16\nFreiheit und Bestimmung, pp. 17-21\nMaß und Unmaß, pp. 22-27\nMensch und Welt, pp. 28-35\nZeitlauf und Erinnerung,pp. 36-43\n\nPoems\n\nGefangen, p. 44\nLied des Einsiedels, pp. 45-46\nZwei Morgenlieder. Bozener Berge I/II, pp. 47-49\nHymnus an die Reise, pp. 50-51\nDer Flieger [Excerpt], pp. 52-54\nHerbstsonett, pp. 55-56\nSteigender Rauch, pp. 57-58\nWinter, p. 59\nBiblische Ballade, pp. 60-61\nLetztes Gedicht: Der Sechzigjährige dankt, pp. 62-63",
      "sourceBlobId": 6
