      "bibliographicCitation": "Address by Mr. Stefan Zweig at the House of Mrs. Anthony de Rothschild, London, on Thursday, November 30, 1933 and to the Committee for the Luncheon at the Savoy Hotel, December 20, 1933, in aid of German Jewish women and children. 8p. London, 1933. Printed as: Their Souls a Mass of Wounds. An Address on the Jewish Children in Germany. Reprinted by the German Relief Fund of the Joint Distribution Committee. 8p. New York, (1933). A copy of this address is located in the Stefan Zweig Collection, Reed Library, State University of New York, Fredonia.",
