. Annotations, p. 199 // 1 letter, 8 September, pp. 142-143. Annotations, p. 202\n\n1927\n\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 1 letter, 18 March, pp. 143-144. Annotations, p. 202\n\n1928\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 1 letter, 1 May, p 144. Annotations, p. 202\n\n1929\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 1 picture postcard, (19 September), p. 144. Annotations, p. 203 // 2 letters, 4 December, p. 145 and 7 December, pp. 148-149. Annotations, pp. 203-205\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 3 letters, 6 December, pp. 145-148;\n9 December, pp. 149-151; and 31 December, pp. 151-152. Annotations, pp. 206-209\n\n1930\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 1 letter, 14 July, pp. 152-153. Annotations, pp. 210-211\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 1 letter, 12 July, p. 152. Annotations, pp. 209-210\n\n1931\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 3 letters, 17 February, pp. 153-155. annotations, p. 211; 25 June, p. 159. Annotation, p. 212; and 28 September, pp. 159-160. Annotations, pp. 212-213 // 1 postcard, May, p. 158. Annotation, p. 212\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 2 picture postcards, February, p. 153. Annotations, p. 211 // 3 letters, 20 February, pp. 155-157. Annotations, pp. 211-212; 16 June, p. 158. Annotations, p. 212; and 29 November, pp. 160-161. Annotations, p. 213 // 1 telegram, 6 May, pp. 157-158. Annotation, p. 212\n\n1932\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 2 letters, 2 June, pp. 161-162. Annotations, pp. 213-214; and 20 October, pp. 164-165. Annotations, p. 215 \nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 3 letters, 2 June, p. 163. Annotations, pp. 214-215; 21 October, pp. 165-166. Annotations, p. 215; and 30 December, pp. 166-167. Annotations, p. 215\n\n1933\n\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 1 letter, (June), p. 167. Annotations, p. 216\n\n1935\n\nSigmund Freud to Stefan Zweig, 1 letter, 5 November, pp. 168-169. Annotations, pp. 217-218\nStefan Zweig to Sigmund Freud, 3 letters, (October/November), p. 168. Annotations, pp. 216-217; 13 September, pp. 169-170. Annotations, p. 218; and 7 No