        "Das Stefan Zweig Buch [Frankfurt am Main, 1981], No. 9, pp. 172-(178)"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "See: Widerstand der Wirklichkeit (VIST)\n\n[1961]: Im Verlag der Internationalen Stefan-Zweig-Gesellschaft, Wien\n\nFragment einer Novelle. Edited by Erich Fitzbauer. 4 lithographs by Hans Fronius. 27p. [Sonderpublikation der Internationalen Stefan-Zweig-Gesellschaft, 2. 500 numbered copies]. This is an excerpt from the story \"Widerstand der Wirklichkeit\". See below\n\nReprinted in:\n\nDas Buch des Gesamtverbandes schaffender Künstler Österreichs. Wien: Verlag des Gesamtverbandes schaffender Künstler Österreichs, (1929), pp. 131-137\nDas Stefan Zweig Buch [Frankfurt am Main, 1981], No. 9, pp. 172-(178)\n\nWiderstand der Wirklichkeit\n\nThe complete work, entitled \"Widerstand der Wirklichkeit\", is located in the Stefan Zweig Archives, London. It consists of 41 numbered typed pages with handwritten corrections by Zweig. On the title page Stefan Zweig had also written a possible subtitle, “Die Reise in die Vergangenheit”, which he then crossed out. \n\nPrinted in:\n\nBrennendes Geheimnis. Erzählungen [Frankfurt am Main, 1987], No. 6, pp. 221-(271)\nPraterfrühling. Erzählungen [Frankfurt am Main, 1990], No. 6, pp. 221-(271) [Fischer Taschenbuch, 9242]",
      "sourceBlobId": 7
