      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Shuxin\"[Briefwechsel/Letters by or to Stefan Zweig] in:\n\nCiweige sanwen [Beijing, 2008] No. 30, pp. 214-261\n\n::[1]. Zhi youren shu [Briefe an Freunde], pp. 214-230\n::[2]. Tong Feiluoyide tongxin xuan [Sigmund Freud / Stefan Zweig: Aus dem Briefwechsel], pp. 231-260\n::[3]. Jueming shu [Stefan Zweig's \"Declaração\" [suicide note], p. 261\n\nCiweige wenji [Taiyuan/Xi'an 1998], Vol. 6, No. 42, pp. 354-484. 74 letters between 2 February 1903 [to Hermann Hesse] and 22 February 1942 [to Friderike Maria Zweig] [Translated by Shuzhi An]\n\n::Recipients:\n::[1]. Felix Braun. 3 letters\n::[2]. Hermann Broch. 1 letter\n::[3]. Hans Carossa. 1 letter\n::[4]. Richard Friedenthal. 2 letters\n::[5]. Maxim Gor’kii. 11 letters\n::[6]. Hermann Hesse. 11 letters\n::[7]. Otto Heuschele. 1 letter\n::[8]. Hugo von Hofmannsthal. 1 letter\n::[9]. Anton Kippenberg. 2 letters\n::[10]. Katharina Kippenberg. 1 letter\n::[11]. Emil Ludwig. 2 letters\n::[12]. Klaus Mann. 3 letters\n::[13]. Thomas Mann. 2 letters\n::[14]. Frans Masereel. 2 letters\n::[15]. Romain Rolland. 13 letters\n::[16]. Joseph Roth. 5 letters\n::[17]. Friderike Maria Zweig. 13 letters",
