      "bibliographicCitation": "“Der Titularfeldwebel. Stefan Zweig im Kriegsarchiv” in Stefan Zweig 1881/1981. Aufsätze und Dokumente, No. 2, pp. 19-55\n\nContains the following letters and documents: \n\nZweig to the Imperial War Ministry, [End of July 1914], p. 19. Notes 7-9, p. 48\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, [Mid-November 1914]), p. 22. Notes 27- 28, p. 49. A photographic reprint of this letter, p. 21\nZweig to Ginzky, [Mid-November 1914], p. 22. Notes 29-30, p. 49\nZweig to Lieutenant Colonel Alois Veltzé, 17 November 1914, pp. 22-23. Notes 31-34, p. 49\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, [End of November 1914], pp. 23-24. Notes 35-38, p. 47\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, [End of November 1914], p. 24. Notes 39-47, p. 49\nA report concerning the bestowal of a medal for bravery [second class] on Aaron Timmeltaler, p. 26. Note 60, p. 50\nA work report [in the Austrian War Archives] for October 1915, p. 26. Note 61, p. 50\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, 26 [June] 1915, p. 27. Note 62, p. 50\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, 12 August 1915, p. 27. Notes 65-73, pp. 50-51\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, 12 July 1915, p. 28. Notes 77-81, p. 51\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, [1] July 1915, p. 28. Notes 82-83, p. 51\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, 26 July 1915, p. 30. Notes 84-88, p. 51\nExcerpts from Zweig’s “Die russische Invasion in Galizien. Ein Capitel Culturgeschichte des Weltkriegs 1914/1915\", pp. 30-32. Notes 89-93, p. 51\nExcerpts from Zweig’s “Exposé einer militärwissenschaftlich-historischen Zeitschrift”, pp. 33-34. Notes 112-113, p. 52\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, [End of March 1917], p. 36. Notes 114-117, p. 52\nZweig to Privy Councilor Friedrich von Wiesner, 28 August 1917, p. 39. Note 145, p. 54\nZweig to Friedrich von Wiesner, 3 September 1917, p. 39. Note 146, p. 54\nZweig to Friedrich von Wiesner, 17 November 1917, pp. 40-41. Notes 147-148, p. 54\nZweig to Friedrich von Wiesner, 1 December 1917, pp. 41-42. Notes 149-151, p. 54\nZweig to Embassy Councilor Dr. Paul Hevesy de Heves, 14 December 1917, pp. 43-44. Notes 160-162, p. 54\nReport from Ambassador Musulin of the Imperial Austro-Hungarian Embassy in Switzerland, [19 Decemebr 1917], p. 44. Notes 161-165, p. 54\nZweig to the Neue Freie Presse [a draft of a contract], 23 December 1917, pp. 44-46. Notes 166-167, p. 54\nZweig to Karl Ginzky, 9 January 1918, p. 46. Note 168, p. 54",
      "sourceBlobId": 2
