      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Der Briefwechsel Joseph Roth / Stefan Zweig 1927-1938\". A lecture read by Siegel on 18 March 2010 at the symposium Actualité(s) de Stefan Zweig. Collogue international, Université de Haute-Alsace, Campus de l'Illberg, Mulhouse, France, 18-19 March 2010\n\n\"Der Briefwechsel Joseph Roth / Stefan Zweig 1927-1938. Ein Werkstattbericht\" in \"Ich liebte Frankreich wie eine zweite Heimat\". Neue Studien zu Stefan Zweig [ 2011], No. 17, pp. 227-238\n\nGeschäft ist Geschäft. Seien Sie mir \"privat\" nicht böse. Ich brauche Geld. Der Briefwechsel zwischen Joseph Roth und den Exilverlagen Allert de Lange und Querido. Edited with an introduction by Madeleine Rietra in conjunction with Rainer-Joachim Siegel. 580/(1)p. Illustrated. Köln: Kiepenheuer & Witsch, 2005. 16 unnumbered pages of photographs between pp. (208)-209. Stefan Zweig and Joseph Roth, p. ( 8)\n\nContents\n\nEinleitung, pp. 11-(89). Zweig referenes, pp. 11, 12, 14, 18, 19, 24, 27, 28, 30, 32, 33, 35-37, 40, 42, 51, 54, 56, 58, 61, 62, 63, 67, 68 [Friderike Maria Zweig], 71, 72, 73, 74, 87-88\n\nDie Briefe, pp. (91)-307. Zweig references. Letters\n \nNo. 1, 26 June 1933 [Annotations, pp. 318, 319, 321]\nNo. 2, 24 July 1933, p. 94 [Annotations, p. 325]\nNo. 3, 23 August 1933, p. 95 [Annotations, pp. 325, 327, 328]\nNo. 12, 30 March 1934 [Annotations, p. 330]\nNo. 13, 30 March 1934 (?) [Annotations, p. 332]\nNo. 20 (May 1934), p. 106 [Annotations, pp. 334, 335, 337]\nNo. 21, 13 May 1934 [Annotations, p. 339]\nNo. 25, 23 May 1934, p. 114 [Annotations, pp. 342, 343]\nNo. 26, 24 May 1934, p. 114\nNo. 42, 5 July 1934, pp. 131, 132 [Annotations, pp. 351, 352]\nNo. 44, 7 July 1934, pp. 134, 135 [Annotations, pp. 353, 354 [Friderike Maria Zweig]\nNo. 45, 10 July 1934, p. 137\nNo. 46, 13 July 1934 [Annotations, p. 356]\nNo. 47, ? July 1934, p. 138 [Annotations, p. 357]\nNo. 50, 18 July 1934, pp. 140, 141 [Annotations, p. 359]\nNo. 52, 21 July 1934, p. 142 [Annotations, p. 360]\nNo. 58, 2 