Die Druckfehler im Antichrist, pp. 541-545. Zweig reference, p. 541\n\nLiteraturverzeichnis, pp. 546-551. Zweig references, pp. 546, 547\n\nVerzeichnis der Briefe, pp. 553-560\n\nRegister, pp. 561-(581). Zweig, Stefan and Friderike, p. (581)\n\nJoseph Roth-Bibliographie. Compiled and edited by Rainer-Joachim Siegel. 551p. Morsum/Sylt: Cicero Presse, 1995\n\nZweig references: \n\nF 4 [Fragmente aus dem Nachlass], p. 372. \"Am Abend des neunten Ab...\" Manuscript fragment in the Reed Library, Fredonia, New York, filed among the letters of Joseph Roth to Stefan Zweig, No.184. Printed in: Joseph Roth. Unter dem Bülowbogen. Prosa der Zeit. Edited by Rainer-Joachim Siegel. Köln: Kiepenheuer & Witsch Verlag, 1994, pp. 325-327\n\nK 1 [Briefe], p. (391). Joseph Roth. Briefe 1911-1939. Edited with and introduction by Hermann Kesten. Köln/Berlin: Kiepenheuer & Witsch Verlag, 1970. Contains 184 letters from Joseph Roth to Stefan Zweig\n\nK 13 [Briefe]. 198 letters, 8 postcards, and 7 telegrams from Joseph Roth to Stefan Zweig. Also contains copies of 3 letters from Joseph Roth to Lotte Altmann (later Lotte Zweig). The originals were in the Zweig Archives, London. Of these letters, 25 plus the letters to Lotte Altmann were not printed in K 1\n\nZ 488 [Sekundärliteratur], p. 473. Fridereike Maria Zweig. Spiegelungen des Lebens. Wien/Stuttgart/Zürich: Deutsch Verlag, 1964\n\nZ 489 [Sekundärliteratur], p. 473. Stefan Zweig / Friderike Maria Zweig. Ein Briefwechsel, 1912-1942. Compiled and edited with a foreword by Friderike Maria Zweig-von Winternitz. Bern: Scherz Verlag, 1951\n\nZ 490 [Sekundärliteratur], p. 473. Stefan Zweig. \"Joseph Roth\" in Europäisches Erbe [1960], No. 22, pp. (251)-264\n\nZ 491 [Sekundärliteratur], p. 473. Stefan Zweig. Briefe an Freunde. Edited by Richard Friedenthal. Frankfurt am main: S. Fischer Verlag, 1978\n \n\nJoseph Roth. Drei Sensationen und zwei Katastrophen. Feuilletons zur Welt des Kinos. Edited with annotations by Helmut Peschina and Rainer-Joa