      "bibliographicCitation": "[1956]: Ḥilmī Murād, al-Qāhirah [Cairo]\n\nAl-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau. Translated by Kalīm Abū Sayf] in ʿĀshiqāt fī ʾl-kharīf [Lovers in Autumn]. Translated by Kalīm Abū Sayf and Anṭūn al-ʿUbaydī. 178p. [Maṭbūʿāt kitābī (Series: ‘My Book’-Prints), 11]\n\nContents:\n\n[1]. Al-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. ??. Translated by Kalīm Abū Sayf\n\n[2]. Al-Umm al-ʿāshiqah [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. ?? Translated by Anṭūn al-ʿUbaydī\n\n[1988]: Maṭbū‘āt al Sharq, [Sydney, Australia?]\n\nAl-Armalah al-'āshiqah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. Translator not indicated. 159p. Illustrated \n\n[1998]: Dār al-Bashīr li-l-Ṭibāʿah waʾn-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, Bayrūt/Dimashq [Béirut/Damascus]\n\n\"Al-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah\" [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau] in ʿĀshiqāt fī ʾl-kharīf [Lovers in Autumn]. Translated by Ḥilmī Murād. 140p. [Series: Rawāʾiʿ al-adab al-ʿālamī (Masterpieces of World Literature), 14)]\n\nContents:\n\nAl-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. ??\nAl-Umm al-ʿāshiqah [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. ??\n\n[2003]: al-Muʾassasah al-ʿArabiyyah al-Ḥadīthah li-l-Ṭabʿ waʾl-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, al-Qāhirah [Cairo]\n\n„Al-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah\" [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau] in ʿĀshiqāt fī ʾl-kharīf [Lovers in Autumn]. Translated by Ḥilmī Murād. 221p. [Series: Maṭbūʿāt Kitābī : iṣdār jadīd (‘My Book’-Prints: New edition)], 48].\n\nContents:\n\nAl-Armalah al-ʿāshiqah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. 5-112\nAl-Umm al-ʿāshiqah [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. 113-221 \nʿAzīzī al-qāriʾ [My Dear Reader by Ḥilmī Murād], on the back cover\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=0B9GL0dOekBwoeUM5enl3MHU0cjQ",
