      ],
      "mainCategory": "Fiction",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Golos zhenshchiny [A Woman's Voice]. An opera triptych based on three literary pieces. Directed by Alla Chepinoga. Music conductor Valery Kritskov. Performance artist and costume designer Lyubov Shepeta. Premiere performance on 16 December 2010 in the Kolobov Novaya Opera Theatre of Moscow\n\nMonooperas:\n\nNezhnost' [Tenderness]. Music and libretto by Vitaly Gubarenko. Based on the novella \"La Tendresse\" by Henri Barbusse. Sung by Olga Ionova, Elena Mitrakova, Elena Terent'eva and Olga Terent'eva\n\nPismo neznakomki [Letter from an Unknown Woman]. Music and libretto by Antonio Spadavekkia. Based on \"Brief einer Unbekannten\" by Stefan Zweig. Sung by Tatiana Smirnova,Valeria Pfister and Anastasia Bibicheva\n\nOzhidanie [Waiting]. Music and libretto by Mikael Tariverdiev. Based on the poem \"Ozhidanie\" by Robert Rozhdestvenskii. Sung by Marina Efanova and Ekaterina Kichigina",
      "sourceBlobId": 6
    },
    {
      "@type": [
        "schema:Movie",
        "klawiter:FilmEntry"
