      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Bei Stefan Zweig steht es anders\" in Die Welt [Hamburg], 16 August 1962. The author takes exception to a remark by Willy Haas to the effect that the Insel-Verlag had \"betrayed Zweig shamefully\" in 1933. See Willy Haas. \"Bermann-Fischer zum Geburtstag\" in Die Welt [Hamburg], 31 July 1962",
      "sourceBlobId": 0
    },
