      "bibliographicCitation": "See: Secondary Literature / Authors (Russian): Azadovskii, Konstantin\n\n“Die Briefe Stefan Zweigs an den Verlag Wremja” in Neue Deutsche Literatur [Berlin], 26:12 [December 1978], pp. 121-128. Contains a 1928 photograph of Zweig in Moscow, a 1930 photograph of Zweig and Maxim Gorki, and an as yet unpublished handwritten note by Zweig, September 1928, which is currently in the manuscript department of the Lenin-Library, Moscow\n\n\"Stefan Zweigs russische Briefpartner\" in Stefan Zweig. Exil und Suche nach dem Weltfrieden. Edited by Mark H. Gelber and Klaus Zelewitz. Riverside, CA: Ariadne Press, 1995, No. 6, pp. 59-72. Reprinted as: “Stefan Zweigs russische Briefpartner (neue Materialien)” in Österreichische Literatur: Interpretationen, Materialien und Rezeption. Jahrbuch der Österreich-Bibliothek in St. Petersburg. 3 (1997/1998). Edited by Alexander W. Belobratow. St. Petersburg: Verlag “Peterburg XXI vek”, (1999), pp. 42-57. See the letters to/from V. Briusov, Pavel Ettinger, F. A. Hünich, Anatolii Lunacharskii, and Sofiia Tolstaia-Esenina",
      "sourceBlobId": 0
