      ],
      "mainCategory": "Historical Studies",
      "decomposedAsWork": "klawiter:work/2327",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1920]: Insel-Verlag, Leipzig\n\nMarceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin. Foreword by Stefan Zweig. Translation of Marceline Desbordes-Valmore’s poems by Gisela Etzel-Kühn. Cover design by F. H. Ehmcke. 349/(2)p. Contains a phototype image of the poetess. Stefan Zweig’s foreword, pp. 5-68. Afterword by Stefan Zweig, p. 349 \n\n[1927]: Insel-Verlag, Leipzig\n\nMarceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin. Revised and expanded edition. Translation of Marceline Desbordes-Valmore’s poems by Gisela Etzel-Kühn and Friderike Maria Zweig. Stefan Zweig’s foreword expanded by the chapter \"Menschlichkeit\". Portaits, a sketch and a medallion by Constant Desbordes, Hilaire Ledru, David d’Angers. 260/(3)p. Contains four phototype images. Stefan Zweig's foreword \"Bildnis ihres Schicksals\", pp. (5)-82. Afterword by Stefan Zweig, p. 260\n\nReview of the 1927 edition\n\nFritz Rosenfeld. “Elegie der Menschenliebe” in Arbeiter-Zeitung [Wien], 15 November 1927 [No. 312], pp. 10-11\nFritz Rosenfeld. “Stephan Zweig: Marceline Desbordes-Valmore, das Lebensbild einer Dichter” in Bildungsarbeit. Blätter für sozialistisches Bildungswesen [Wien], 14:12 [December 1927], p. (232)",
      "sourceBlobId": 5
    },
