      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Fantaisie\". This poem contains 12 lines [three stanzas] and Zweig's signature. The autographed leaf was sold at auction by the Dorotheum-Kunstabteilung, Wien, 14 October 1970. The present owner is unknown. The first line reads: \"Mein Herz entstammt der Glut, aus Sonne ward mein Geist...\"\n\nFrench original: \"Fantaisie\" in La Lyre turque: Feux de paradise et roses d'enfer. By Abdullah Cevdet [Djevdet]. Preface by Gustave Kahn. XI/1175p. Portrait of the poet. Wien: G. Frick Verlag, 1902, p. 99",
