      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"A Promise: interview with Patrice Leconte\" in The Upcoming [London/New York], 6 September 2013. The interview was conducted and written by the Editorial Unit of the The Upcoming in London. \"French director Patrice Leconte adapted the novel of Stefan Zweig Journey into the Past (Widerstand der Wirklichkeit) and for the first time made a movie in English. Starring Rebecca Hall, Alan Rickman and Richard Madden, the picture tells a complicated love story that faces the challenge of time and distance separation in the Germany of early 20th century...\". See: theupcoming.co.uk/2013/09/06/a-promise-an-interview-with-patrice-leconte/",
      "sourceBlobId": 1
    },
