      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Ernest Renan. Zum Jahrhundertage seiner Geburt am 27. Februar 1823\" in in Neue Freie Presse [Wien], 25 February 1923, pp. (1)-6\n\nReprinted in:\n\nBegegnungen mit Menschen, Büchern, Städten [Wien/Leipzig/Zurich, 1937], No. 34, pp. (396)-411; [Frankfurt am Main, 1955], No. 34, pp. 373-386\nEssays. Auswahl 1907-1924 [Leipzig, 1983], No. 49, pp. 554-569\nZeiten und Schicksale. Aufsätze und Vorträge aus den Jahren 1902-1942 [Frankfurt am Main, 1990], No. 10, pp. 105-122\n\nReprinted as:\n\n\"Ernest Renan. Zu seinem Jahrhunderttage\" in Der Feuerreiter [Berlin], 2:3 [May 1923], pp. 65-76 \n\nReprinted as:\n\n\"Ernest Renan\" in Ernest Renan. Jugenderinnerungen. Translated by Hannah Szass. Foreword by Stefan Zweig. 320p. Frankfurt am Main: Frankfurter Verlags-Anstalt, 1925. Stefan Zweig's foreword \"Ernest Renan\", pp. 5-(27)\n\nTranslations:\n\nChinese: \"Ensite Lenan\" in Ciweige sanwen xuan [Tianjin, 2002], No. 17, pp. 264-282\n\nDanish: \"Renan\" in Franske portraetter [København, 1961], No. 4, pp. 152-171\n\nFrench: \"Ernest Renan\" in Souvenirs et rencontres [Paris, 1951 and 1997]: [1951], No. 11, pp. (153)-161; [1997], No. 12, pp. (141)-148\n\nGreek: \"Ernestos Renan\" in Anamnēseis kai synantēseis [Athēna, 1956], No. 10, pp. 117-123 // \"Renan\" in O kosmos tes technes [Athēna, No date indicated], No. 3, pp. ??\n\nHungarian: \"Ernest Renan...\" in [1]. Emberek, könyvek, városok. Válogatott tanulmányok [Budapest, 1939], No. 16, pp. 223-240. [2]. Örök tüzek [Budapest, 1946], No. 3, pp. 79-97\n\nItalian: \"Ernest Renan\" in Incontri e amicizie [Milano/Verona, 1950], No. 6, pp. 85-106\n\nPortuguese: \"Ernest Renan\" in [1]. Encontros [Porto, 1960], Vol. III, No. 3, pp. 117-140. [2]. Encontros com homens, livros e países [Rio de Janeiro, 1939], No. 30, pp. 344-357. [3]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1934-1950 [Rio de Janeiro, 1934-1950], Vol. 10, No. 34, pp. (341)-353. [4]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1960 [Rio de Janeiro, 19