        "@value": "Unpublished Letters from the Correspondence between Stefan Zweig and Elsa Germani 1921-1937 / Cartas inéditas de Zweig para Elsa Germani 1921-1937",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "sourceTextId": 32285,
