      "mainCategory": "Correspondence",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Jeffrey B. Berlin. \"The Unpublished Correspondence between Albert Einstein and Stefan Zweig (with an unpublished Zweig Manifesto of 1933 and letters to Max Brod, Ben Huebsch, and Felix Salten)\" in Brücken über dem Abgrund / Bridging the Abyss [1994], pp. (337)-363. Contains 30 letters or excerpts: \n\nStefan to Albert Einstein, 8 letters, 22 September 1920 - Undated 1936\nStefan Zweig + friends, two short greetings, 31 August 1920 [a telegram] and January 1932 [a note]\nAlbert Einstein to Stefan Zweig, 2 letters and a note, 10 November 1920, 18 October 1930, 28 June 1933\nStefan Zweig to Romain Rolland [about Einstein], 5 letters/excerpts, 17 February 1920 - 10 June 1933\nStefan Zweig to Ben Huebsch, 6 letters [excerpts about Einstein], 18 March 1933 - 8 June 1934\nElsa Einstein [Albert's second wife] to Stefan Zweig, 1 letter, 9 June 1933\nStefan Zweig to Elsa Einstein, 1 letter, 16 June 1933\nStefan Zweig to Felix Salten, 1 letter [references to Einstein], 7 May 1933\nStefan Zweig to Max Brod, 1 letter [references to Einstein], 9 May 1933\nFriderike Maria Zweig to Albert Einstein, 1 letter, 26 November 1944\nAlbert Einstein to Friderike Maria Zweig, 1 letter, 3 December 1944",
      "sourceBlobId": 1
    },
