      "bibliographicCitation": "[1966]: No publisher indicated, Beograd/Strasbourg\n\nRomen Rolan i Stefan Cvaig = Romain Rolland et Stefan Zweig. This is a collection of eight articles by Dragoljub-Dragan Nedeljković from journals published in Beograd, Strasbourg and Sarajevo between 1956-1966\n\nContents:\n\n\"Romen Rolan i Stefan Cvaig - dva vida modernog evropskog humanizma. Uz dvadesetogodisnjicu smrti Stefana Cvaijga\" in Pregled [Periodical for Social Issues, University of Sarajevo], Volume number and date of publication not indicated, pp. (29)-45. Continued on pp. (179)-196\n\"Romain Rolland et Stefan Zweig. Les annees de crise et de recherche 1919-1923\" in Filoloski pregled [The Philosophical Review. The University of Beograd], I-II [1965], pp. (153)-180. This is an excerpt from the author's doctoral dissertation\nRomen Rolan i Stefan Tsvaij: Dva ctava prema fashizmu i revolutsiji. Beograd: Izdavackko Preduzene \"Rad\" , 1965, ppp. (171)--226. Resume: Romain Rolland et Stefan Zweig: Deux attitudes a l'egard du fascisme et de la revolution\", p. 226\n\"Romen Rolan i Stefan Cvaig pred moralnom dekadencijom novoga sveta\" in Pregled [University of Sarajevo], Volume number and date of publication not indicated, pp. (49)-71\n\"Romen Rolan i Stefan Cvaig. Suton\" in Pregled [University of Sarajevo], Volume number and date of publication not indicated, pp. (291)-302",
