      "inLanguage": "de",
      "languageName": "German",
      "numberOfPages": 802,
      "categories": [
        "Correspondence / Volumes (German)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Correspondence",
      "hasPart": [
        "Humanismus und Revolution [Wolfgang Klein], pp. (5)-25",
        "Vorbemerkung des Verlages [Waltraud Schwarze], pp. (26)-27",
        "Briefe 1910-1923, pp. (29)-778",
        "Zeittafel [Chronological and biographical data. Gerhard Schewe and Gerda Böttcher], pp. (781)-802",
        "Inhalt, p. (803)"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1987]: Rütten & Loening, Berlin\n\nRomain Rolland - Stefan Zweig. Briefwechsel 1910-1940. 2 vols. Collector of manuscripts and editor Waltraud Schwarze. Introduction by Wolfgang Klein. Chronological and biographical data assembled by Gerhard Schewe and Gerda Böttcher. Rolland's letters translated from French into German by Eva and Gerhard Schewe. Zweig's letters translated from French into German by Christel Gersch.\n\nVolume 1. 802/(2)p. Frontispiece: A 1925 photograph of Romain Rolland by Stefan Zweig\n\nContents: \n\nHumanismus und Revolution [Wolfgang Klein], pp. (5)-25\nVorbemerkung des Verlages [Waltraud Schwarze], pp. (26)-27\nBriefe 1910-1923, pp. (29)-778\nZeittafel [Chronological and biographical data. Gerhard Schewe and Gerda Böttcher], pp. (781)-802\nInhalt, p. (803)\n\nBriefe [Correspondence]\n \n\n1910, p. 31\n\nRolland to Zweig, 1 letter, 1 May\n\n1911, pp. (32)-36\n\nRolland to Zweig, 2 letters, 18 February and 19 April\nZweig to Rolland, 3 letters, 12 February, 23 April, 26 April\n\n1912, pp. (37)-51\n\nRolland to Zweig, 4 letters and 1 postal card, 23 February-26 December\nZweig to Rolland, 3 letters and 3 postal cards, 17 February-24 December . The letter of 24 December contains [pp. 44-50] a copy of \"Brief an Romain Rolland von Stefan Zweig\" which had appeared in the Berliner Tageblatt [Berlin], 22 December 1912\n\n1913, pp. (52)-67\n\nRolland to Zweig, 11 letters and 1 postal card, 2 January-30 October\nZweig to Rolland, 8 letters and 4 postal cards, 24 January-27 August. The letter of 18 April contains [p. 60] a reprint of the poem \"An Romain Rolland\" by Friderike von Winternitz\n\n1914, pp. (68)-125\n\nRolland to Zweig, 17 letters and 5 postal cards, 21 March-22 December. The letter of 28 September concerns a letter Rolland had written to the Berliner Tageblatt in response to Zweig's \"An die Freunde in Fremdland\" which had appeared in the Berliner Tageblatt [Berlin], 19 September 1914\nZweig to Rolland, 15 letters and 3 postal cards, 8 April-23 December\n\n1915, pp. (126)-228\n\nRolland to Zweig, 24 letters and 3 postal cards, 11 January-29 December. The letter of 2 June contains [pp. 185-186] the poem \"An meine Freunde in Ost und West\" by Frederik van Eeden\nZweig to Rolland, 34 letters and 12 postal cards, 2 January-30 December\nFriderike von Winternitz to Rolland, 1 letter, 22 April\n\n1916, pp. (229)-258\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters, 7 January-30 November\nZweig to Rolland, 10 letters, 1 postal card and 3 telegrams, 17 January-5 December\n\n1917, pp. (259)-287\n\nRolland to Zweig, 8 letters, 3 March-29 December\nZweig to Rolland, 10 letters, 18 February-31 December\n\n1918, pp. (288)-416\n\nRolland to Zweig, 34 letters and 2 postal cards, 1 January-28 December\nZweig to Rolland, 37 letters and 1 postal card, 6 January-30 December\nFriderike von Winternitz to Rolland, 1 letter, 3 March\nRolland to Friderike von Winternitz, 1 letter, 14 June\n\n1919, pp. (417)-489\n\nRolland to Zweig, 18 letters, 2 postal cards and 2 telegrams, 2 January-21 November\nZweig to Rolland, 16 letters and 1 telegram, 2 January-29 November\nRolland to Friderike von Winternitz, 1 letter, 12 January\n\n1920, pp. (490)-603\n\nRolland to Zweig, 27 letters and 5 postal cards, 4 January-19 December\nZweig to Rolland, 22 letters and 2 postal cards, 10 January-30 December. A photographic copy of Zweig's letter to Rolland of 5 May is inserted between pages 532-533\nMadeleine Rolland to Zweig, 3 letters, 4 May, 15 June, 19 June\n\n1921, pp. (604)-670\n\nRolland to Zweig, 17 letters and 2 postal cards, 2 January-31 December\nZweig to Rolland, 19 letters and 1 postal card, 6 January-6 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter, 24 November\n\n1922, pp. (671)-724\n\nRolland to Zweig, 12 letters, 21 January-14 December\nZweig to Rolland, 14 letters, 4 January-3 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter, 29 November\nRolland to Friderike Zweig, 1 letter, 2 December\n\n1923, pp. (725)-778\n\nRolland to Zweig, 13 letters and 1 postal card, 18 January-3 December\nZweig to Rolland, 14 letters and 1 postal card, 3 January-28 November\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 2 letters, 12 April, 18 August\nRolland to Friderike Zweig, 6 letters, 21 April-25 December\n\nVolume 2. 767/(2)p. Frontispiece: A 1926 portrait of Zweig by Frans Masereel\n\nContents:\n\nBriefe 1924-1940, pp. (7)-722\nZeittafel [Chronological and biographical data. Gerhard Schewe and Gerda Böttcher], pp. (725)-743\nRegister, pp. (744)-767\nInhalt, p. (769)\n\nBriefe [Correspondence]\n\n1924, pp. (7)-62\n\nRolland to Zweig, 14 letters, 4 postal cards and 1 telegram, 3 January-19 December\nZweig to Rolland, 12 letter and 2 postal cards, Beginning of January-16 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter, 9 January\nMadeleine Rolland to Zweig, 1 telegram, 4 May\n\n1925, pp. (63)-144\n\nRolland to Zweig, 21 letters and 1 postal card, 18 January-17 December\nZweig to Rolland, 26 letters, 1 postal card and a note written on the margin of a letter to Zweig from the Insel-Verlag [16 February], 3 January-30 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 note added to Zweig's letter of 26 January\nPages 75-77 contain a reprint of Otto Reiner's review article \"Ein Spiel von Tod und Liebe. Uraufführung des Dramas von Romain Rolland am Deutschen Schauspielhaus in Hamburg\" in the Frankfurter Zeitung [Frankfurt am Main], 25 February 1925\n\n1926, pp. (145)-202\n\nRolland to Zweig, 19 letters and 4 postal cards, 8 January-25 December\nZweig to Rolland, 16 letters and 4 postal cards, 11 January-30 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter with a note from Suse von Winternitz, 18 January\n\n1927, pp. (203)-264\n\nRolland to Zweig, 15 letters and 4 postal cards, 5 January-25 December\nZweig to Rolland, 20 letters, 5 postal cards and 2 telegrams, 27 January-27 December\nRolland to Friderike Zweig, 1 letter, 5 January\n\n1928, pp. (265)-313\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters, 4 postal cards and 1 telegram, 2 February-18 December\nZweig to Rolland, 13 letters and 4 postal cards, (January?)-5 December. The letter of (January?) also contains greetings from Friderike Zweig\n\n1929, pp. (314)-349\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters and 2 postal cards, 17 January-30 December. A photographic copy of Rolland's letter to Zweig of 23 September is inserted between pp. 336-337\nZweig to Rolland, 9 letters and 6 postal cards, 20 January-28 December\n\n1930, pp. (350)-399\n\nRolland to Zweig, 12 letters and 3 postal cards, 20 February-5 October\nZweig to Rolland, 15 letters and 2 postal cards, 3 January-28 November\nRolland to Friderike Zweig, 1 letter, 3 August\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 2 letters, 31 July, 5 August\n\n1931, pp. (400)-441\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters and 2 postal cards, 5 February-30 December\nZweig to Rolland, 11 letters and 4 postal cards, 8 January-28 December\n\n1932, pp. (442)-485\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters, 20 February-31 December\nZweig to Rolland, 15 letters and 1 postal card, 1 February-18 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 postal card, 24 March\n\n1933, pp. (486)-553\n\nRolland to Zweig, 13 letters, 18 January-26 December\nZweig to Rolland, 24 letters and 6 postal cards, 1 January-18 December\nRolland to Friderike Zweig, 1 letter, 30 August\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 3 letters, 23 January, 1 September and 5 December\n\n1934, pp. (554)-590\n\nRolland to Zweig, 10 letters, 17 January-26 December\nZweig to Rolland, 12 letters and 2 postal cards, 11 January-21 December\n\n1935, pp. (591)-615\n\nRolland to Zweig, 6 letters, 29 March-30 December\nZweig to Rolland, 8 letters and 5 postal cards, 29 January-12 December\n\n1936, pp. (616)-643\n\nRolland to Zweig, 8 letters, 28 January-9 December\nZweig to Rolland, 9 letters and 1 postal card, 7 January-5 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter, 2 January\nZweig to Marie Rolland, 1 letter, 20 November\n\n1937, pp. (644)-668\n\nRolland to Zweig, 5 letters, 22 February-30 November\nZweig to Rolland, 9 letters, 18 February-7 December\n\n1938, pp. (669)-694\n\nRolland to Zweig, 9 letters, 15 February-5 December\nZweig to Rolland, 7 letters and 1 picture post card, 16 February-21 December\nFriderike Zweig to Rolland, 1 letter, 5 May\n\n1939, pp. (695)-717\n\nRolland to Zweig, 5 letters and 1 postal card, 17 March-18 December\nZweig to Rolland, 9 letters and 3 postal cards, 10 January-11 December\n\n1940, pp. (718)-722\n\nRolland to Zweig, 2 letters, 20 February, 7 April\nZweig to Rolland, 3 letters and 1 postal card, 13 February-19 April",
