      "bibliographicCitation": "\"In dieser dunklen Stunde\" in Aufbau [New York], Vol. VII:No. 20 [16 May 1941], p. 3 . This is a lecture delivered by Stefan Zweig on 15 May 1941 at the PEN banquet in the Biltmore Hotel in New York on the occasion of the creation of the European PEN in America\n\nReprinted in:\n\nDie schlaflose Welt. Aufsätze und Vorträge aus den Jahren 1909-1941 [Frankfurt am Main, 1983], No. 33, pp. 276-(278)\n\nStefan Zweig - Abschied von Europa [Wien, 2014], No. 21, pp. 275-276\n\nFrench translation:\n\n\"En cette heure sombre\" in Essais [Paris, 1996], No. 14, pp. 1272-1273. Translated by Isabelle Hausser\n\n\"En cette heure sombre\" in Stefan Zweig. L'Esprit européen en exil [Paris, 2020], No. 56, pp.(379)-382. Translated by Jacques Le Rider",
      "sourceBlobId": 6
