      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Nikol'skaia, T. \"Stefan Zweig glasami Grigola Robakidze. Primechanie k teme\" in Rossia i Zapad. Sbornik v chest' K. M. Azadovskogo. Compiled by M. Besrodnyi et al. 635p. Moskva: Novoe literaturnoe obozrenie, 2011, pp. 341-344 [Nauchnaya biblioteka]. This is an account of the private meeting of Stefan Zweig and Grigol Robakidze in Moscow in 1928 during the 100th anniversary celebration of the birth of Leo Tolstoi. The passage from Grigol Robakidze's essay \"Dni Tolstogo\", written as a diary and his entry in this diary dated 13 September 1928, are included in this article.",
      "sourceBlobId": 1
