      "bibliographicCitation": "[2006]: Suhrkamp Verlag, Frankfurt am Main\n\nHermann Hesse - Stefan Zweig. Briefwechsel. Edited with an afterword by Volker Michel. 206/(3)p. Illustrated\n\nBriefe [Correspondence] 1903-1938\n\n1903, pp. 7-30\n\nHesse to Zweig, 5 letters, (January)-2 November\nZweig to Hesse, 6 letters, 2 February-(ca. December)\n\n1904, pp. 30-69\n\nHesse to Zweig, 12 letters, 4 January-26 November\nZweig to Hesse, 9 letters, (17 January?)-21 November\n\n1905, pp. 69-77\n\nHesse to Zweig, 5 letters, (23 March)-(June)\nZweig to Hesse, 3 letters, 4 April, (end of July), 17 October\n\n1906, p. 78\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (end of December)\n\n1907, pp. 78-79\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, 21 February\n\n1908, pp. 79-86\n\nHesse to Zweig, 7 letters, 1 April-(23 October)\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, 28 September, 1 picture post card from India, (end of 1908?)\n\n1909, pp. 86-87\n\nHesse, to Zweig, 1 letter, (March)\n\n1910, p. 87\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (summer)\n\n1915, pp. 88-94\n\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, 9 November\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, 20 November\n\n1917, pp. 95-96\n\nHesse to Zweig, 3 letters, 13 September, 20 November, (ca. end of 1917)\n\n1918, pp. 97-105\n\nZweig to Hesse, 5 letters, 18 February-(ca. end of October)\nHesse to Zweig, 3 letters, 25 February, (March), 15 November\n\n1920, pp. 105-109\n\nZweig to Hesse, 2 letters, 28 July, 2 November\nHesse to Zweig, 2 letters, 4 August (postmark)-10 November\n\n1922, pp. 113-117\n\nZweig to Hesse, 2 letters, (ca. autumn), 13 December\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, 27 November\n\n1923, pp. 127-129\n\nHesse to Zweig, 2 letters, 10 February, 14 March\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, 21 February\n\n1925, pp. 129-133\n\nZweig to Hesse, 2 letters, (20 February), 14 May\nHesse to Zweig, 3 letters, 17 May, (Stuttgart 1925), (29 May)\n\n1926, pp. 134-137\n\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, (6 November)\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, 10 November\n\n1928, p. 137\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (3 November)\n\n1929, p. 138\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (3 November)\n\n1933, pp. 139-140\n\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, 9 December\n\n1934, p. 141\n\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (ca. 1934)\n\n1935, pp. 141-153\n\nZweig to Hesse, 2 letters, 30 January, 4 May\nHesse to Zweig, 3 letters, (15) February, (ca. 20 February), (18 April)\n\n1936, pp. 153-154\n\nZweig to Hesse, 1 postal card, London (1934)\nHesse to Zweig, 1 letter, (17 August)\n\n1937, pp. 155-158\n\nHesse to Zweig, 3 letters, (25 June), (13 September), 10 November\nZweig to Hesse, 2 letters, (12 September), (17 September)\n\n1938, pp. 158-163\n\nHesse to Zweig, 2 letters, 7 July, 27 July\nZweig to Hesse, 1 letter, 9 July\n\nBibliographic data:\n\nNachwort des Herausgebers [Volker Michels], pp. 165-199\nEditorische Notiz und Dank [Volker Michels], pp. 200-(201)\nPersonenregister, pp. 203-(207)\nInhalt, p. (209)\n\nReviews by Hermann Hesse and Stefan Zweig:\n\nEin Roman von Hermann Hesse [Stefan Zweig], pp. 37-39. Appeared first in Die Freistatt [München], 6:14 [2 April 1904], p. 270. Review of: Hermann Hesse. Peter Camenzind. Berlin: S. Fischer Verlag, 1904\nAusgewählte Gedichte von Emile Verhaeren. In Nachdichtung von Stefan Zweig [Hermann Hesse], pp. 46-47. Appeared first in Das litterarische Echo [Berlin], 7:2 [15 October 1904], col. 156. Review of: Emile Verhaeren. Ausgewählte Gedichte in Nachdichtung von Stefan Zweig. Berlin: Schuster & Loeffler Verlag, 1904\nDie Liebe der Erika Ewald. Novellen [Hermann Hesse], pp. 64-65. Appeared first in Das litterarische Echo [Berlin], 7:4 [15 November 1904], cols. 291-292. Review of: Stefan Zweig. Die Liebe der Erika Ewald. Novellen. Berlin: Fleischel Verlag, 1904\nDrei Meister: Balzac - Dickens - Dostojewski [Hermann Hesse], p. 110. Appeared first in Vivos voco. Zeitschrift für neues Deutschtum [Leipzig], 1:12 [February 1920], p. 817. Review of: Stefan Zweig. Drei Meister: Balzac - Dickens - Dostojewski. Leipzig: Insel Verlag, 1920\nRomain Rolland [Hermann Hesse], p. 111. Appeared first in Wissen und Leben. Schweizerische Halbmonatsschrift [Zürich], 14:15 [15 June 1921], p. 740. Review of: Stefan Zweig. Romain Rolland. Der Mann und das Werk. Frankfurt am Main: Rütten & Loening Verlag, 1921\nMarceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin [Hermann Hesse], p. 112. Appeared first in Vivos voco. Zeitschrift für neues Deutschtum [Leipzig], 2:9 [February 1922], p. 543. Review of: Stefan Zweig. Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin. Leipzig: Insel Verlag, 1920\nTriumph und Tragik des Erasmus von Rotterdam [Hermann Hesse], p. 147 [An excerpt]. Appeared first in Bonniers litterära magasin [BLM] [Stockholm], 4:7 [September 1935], pp. 50-57. Review of: Stefan Zweig. Triumph und Tragik des Erasmus von Rotterdam. Wien: Reichner Verlag, 1934\n\nEssay by Stefan Zweig:\n\nDer Weg Hermann Hesses, pp. 118-126. Appeared first in Neue Freie Presse [Wien], 6 February 1923, pp. (1)-3. See: Die Monotonisierung der Welt. Aufsätze und Vorträge [1976], No. 19, pp. 218-225\n\nPhotographs:\n\nPage (8): The cover of Stefan Zweig's Silberne Saiten. Gedichte. Berlin/Leipzig: Schuster & Loeffler Verlag, 1901\nPage (36): The cover of Hermann Hesse's Peter Camenzind. Berlin: S. Fischer Verlag, 1904\nPage (45): The cover of Emile Verhaeren. Ausgewählte Gedichte in Nachdichtung von Stefan Zweig. Berlin: Schuster und Loeffler Verlag, 1904\nPage (63): The cover of Stefan Zweig's Die Liebe der Erika Ewald. Novellen. Berlin: Fleischel Verlag, 1904\nBetween pp. 112-113: 16 photographs of Stefan Zweig, Hermann Hesse, and scenes related to them\nPage (148): The book jacket of Stefan Zweig's Triumph und Tragik des Erasmus von Rotterdam. Wien: Reichner Verlag, 1935\n\nReview of this volume:\n\nH.-Georg Lützenkirchen. \"Noble Individualität. Der Briefwechsel zwischen Hermann Hesse und Stefan Zweig\". See: http://www.literaturkritik.de/public/rezension.php?rez_id=10192",
      "sourceBlobId": 2
