      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Zweig über Ambrosi\" in Gustinus Ambrosi-Mappe. Foreword by Felix Braun. 54 plates. 4 pages of text. Wien/Leipzig: Eduard Strache Verlag, 1919. Zweig's remarks were taken from his contribution to the subscription advertisements for the Gustinus Ambrosi-Mappe. Foreword by Felix Braun. Wien/Leipzig: Eduard Strache Verlag, 1916.\n\n\"Stefan Zweig über Ambrosi\" in Gustinus Ambrosi-Mappe. Foreword by Fritz Karpfen. Various pagings. 10 plates. Wien/Leipzig: Stein Verlag, 1925, p. 14\n\n\"Stefan Zweig über Ambrosi\" in Ambrosi-Festschrift. Edited by Franz F. Harony. Wien: Burgenland Verlag, 1948, p. 14 [Die Fähre. Sonderdruck, 1948]. Photograph of Ambrosi's bust of Stefan Zweig, p. 27\n\nSee: \"Aus Ambrosis Tagebüchern\" in Ambrosi, Gustinus",
