      "bibliographicCitation": "[2007]: Yordam Kitap, Istanbul\n\nMektuplaşmalar (1912-1942). Stefan Zweig - Friderike Zweig. Translated by Ahmet Arpad with a foreword by Ahmet Arpad and Burhan Arpad. Afterword by Gert Kerschbaumer. 404p. Illustrated with 13 photographs. 1st edition. See: Stefan Zweig - Friderike Zweig. \"Wenn einen Augenblick die Wolken weichen\". Briefwechsel 1912-1942.\n\nContents:\n\n\"Savaşlara karşi savaşmalıyız...\" Stefan Zweig üzerine düşünceler [\"Wir müssen Kriege bekämpfen...\"Gedanken über Stefan Zweig. Ahmet Arpad and Burhan Arpad], pp. (9)-(12)\nSokulma (1912-1918) [Die Annäherung], pp. (13)-80\nKapuzinerberg (1919-1927) [Kapuzinerberg 5], pp. (81)-206\nSürüncemede (1928-1933) [In der Schwebe], pp. (207)-277\nSoğuma (1934-1937) [Die Abstoßung], pp. (279)-341\nSürgünde (1938-1942) [Im Exil], pp. (343)-393\nStefan ve Friderike [Stefan und Friderike. Gert Kerschbaumer, Salzburg, 2006], pp. (397)-404\n\n[2015]: Ayrıntı Yayınları, Istanbul\n\nMektuplaşmalar (1912-1942). Stefan Zweig - Friderike Zweig. Translated with a foreword by Ahmet Arpad. Afterwords by Gert Kerschbaumer and Ahmet Cemal. Cover design by Gökçe Alper. 474p. Illustrated\n\nContents:\n\nSürgünde bir yazar [Ein Autor im Exil. Ahmet Arpad], pp. 9-16\nSokulma (1912-1918) [Die Annäherung], pp. 17-98\nKapuzinerberg (1919-1927) [Kapuzinerberg 5], pp. 99-244\nSürüncemede (1928-1933) [In der Schwebe], pp. 245-325\nSoğuma (1934-1937) [Die Abstoßung], pp. 326-397\nSürgünde (1938-1942) [Im Exil], pp. 398-459\nStefan ve Friderike [Stefan und Friderike. Gert Kerschbaumer, Salzburg, 2006], pp. 460-467\nStefan Zweig ve \"mektup sanatı\" [Stefan Zweig und \"die Kunst des Briefschreibens\". Ahmet Cemal], pp. 468-474",
