      "bibliographicCitation": "[2008]: Edition Graphischer Zirkel, Eichgraben im Wenerwald\n\nBriefe und Werknotizen. Im Faksimile der Handschrift. Edited with a foreword and typed versions of Zweig's autograph material by Erich Fitzbauer. (51)p. [Buchpublikation der Edition Graphischer Zirkel, 152]\n\n\"Lieber der Gott sein vom ersten Tag ... \" [Poem by Zweig], p. (1)\n(Foreword) [Erich Fitzbauer], pp. (4)-(8)\nBriefe, pp. (9)-(31)\n\nSehr geehrter Herr Klammer [1901?/ 1902?], autograph facsimile, p. (10) / typed version, p. (25)\nMein lieber Victor, undated, autograph facsimile, pp. (11)-(12 / typed version, pp. (25)-(26)\nVerehrter Herr Director, 11 September 1911, autograph facsimile, pp. (13)-(15) / typed version, pp. (26)-(27)\nCara moglie [i.e Friderike Maria Zweig], Fall 1922, autograph facsimile, pp. (16)-(18) / typed version, pp. (27)-(28)\nMein lieber Freund, undated, autograph facsimile, pp. (19)-(20) / typed version, pp. (28)-(29)\nLiebe Mama [i.e. Ida Zweig], 10 August 1938, autograph facsimile, pp. (21)-(22) / typed version, p. (30)\nLiebe Liesl, Rio, Hotel Paysandú, no date, autograph facsimile, pp. (23)-(24) / typed version, pp. (30)-(31)\n\nWerknotizen zu der Autobiographie Die Welt von gestern, pp. (32)-(49)\n\nIch bin 1881 in einem Lande geboren, das nicht mehr existiert. . ., autograph facsimile, p. (33) / typed version, p. (45)\nSchule, autograph facsimile, pp. (34)-(35) / typed version, pp. (45)-(46)\nSec., autograph facsimile, p. (36) / typed version, p. (46)\nParis. Vergangenheit. Anatol France. . ., autograph facsimile, p. (37) / typed version, p. (46)\nBazalgette. Der frühe französische Freud. . ., autograph facsimile, p. (38)-(39) / typed version, pp. (46)-(47)\nKrieg 1914, autograph facsimile, p. (39) / typed version, p. (47)\nBahnhofsbuffet in Buchs, autograph facsimile, p. (40) / typed version, p. (47)\nSalzburg, Faistauer. . . Bahr, autograph facsimile, p. (41) / typed version, p. (47)\nMussolini, autograph facsimile, pp. (41) / typ