      "workTranslation": [
        "Bulgarian: \"Evropeĭskata misŭl v neĭnoto istorichesko razvitie\" in [1]. Evropeĭskata misŭl [Varna, 1985], No. 21, pp. 320-338. [2]. Stefan Tsvaig. Izbrani tvorbi v pet toma [Sofija, 1987-1989], Vol. 4, No. 8, pp. 58-78"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Der europäische Gedanke in seiner historischen Entwicklung\". This is a lecture deliver by Stefan Zweig in Firenze (Florence), Italy, on 5 May 1932. This lecture was delivered at least twice again: Once in the Ottakringer Volksheim, Wien, on 28 January 1933 [See: F. R. \"Zur Geschichte des europäischen Gedankens. Ein Vortrag von Stefan Zweig\" in Arbeiter Zeitung [Wien], 29 January 1933, p. 7] and a second time in Basle on 14 March 1933 [See: sk. \"Stefan Zweig spricht über den europäischen Gedanken\" in Basler Nachrichten [Basel],, 15 March 1933, p. (1)]. For a summary of a lecture of seemingly identical content delivered by Stefan Zweig in the Pulchri Studio, 's Gravenhage (The Hague) see: \"De europeesche gedachte in de litteratuur: De kleine Staten moeten als het cement tussen de groote blokken zijn, zegt Stefan Zweig\" in Het Vaderland ['s Gravenhage / The Hague], 20 March 1929 [Evening edition], p. (1)\n\nPrinted as a Volume:\n\nDer europäische Gedanke in seiner historischen Entwicklung. Edited with notes and an afterword by Nobuo Iizuka. 43/(2)p. Tokyo: Acacia, 1957. The text is in German; the notes and the afterword [pp. (44)-(45)] are in Japanese. See also: Iizuka, Nobuo. \"Stefan Zweig und der europäische Gedanke\" in Doitsu Bungaku [Tokyo], No. 18 [May 1957], pp. (121)-129\n\nReprinted in:\n\nEssays. Auswahl 1929-1942 [Leipzig, 1990], No. 7, pp. 343-364\n\nDie Monotonisierung der Welt. Aufsätze und Vorträge [Frankfurt am Main, 1976], No. 5, pp. 47-71\n\nDie schlaflose Welt. Aufsätze und Vorträge aus den Jahren 1909-1941 [Frankfurt am Main, 1983/2003], No. 27, pp. 185-(210)\n\nZeit und Welt [Frankfurt am Main, 1981], No. 16, pp. 117-137\n\nZeit und Welt. Gesammelte Aufsätze und Vorträge 1904-1940 [Stockholm, 1943], No. 19, pp. (323)-352; [Stockholm, 1946], No. 19, pp. (299)-326\n \n\nTranslations:\n\nBulgarian: \"Evropeĭskata misŭl v neĭnoto istorichesko razvitie\" in [1]. Evropeĭskata misŭl [Varna, 1985], No. 21, pp. 320-338. [2]. Stefan Tsvaig. Izbrani tvorbi v pet toma [Sofija, 1987-1989], Vol. 4, No. 8, pp. 58-78\n\nEnglish: \"European Thought in Its Historical Development\" in Messages from a Lost World [London, 2016], No. 13, pp. (85)-111\n\nFrench: \"La Pensée européenne dans son développement historique\" in Derniers messages [Paris/Neuchâtel, 1949], No. 3, pp. (33)-57. [2]. Derniers messages [Paris, 2013], No. 4, pp. (53)-78\n\nHungarian: \"Az európai gondolat történelmi feijlödése\" in Idö és világ [Budapest, 1946], No. 19, pp. 168-183\n\nJapanese: \"Yoroppa shiso no rekishiteki hatten\" in [1]. Asu no rekishi. Seiyo bunkashi ronshu [Tokyo, 1958], No. 2, pp. 35-71. [2]. Yoroppa shiso no rekishiteki hatten [Tokyo, 1967], No. 1, pp. 5-41. [3]. \"Geijutsu soso no himitsu\" in Tsuvaiku zenshu [Tokyo, 1961-1965], Vol. 19, No. 1, pp. 5-36. [4]. Tsuvaiku zenshu [Tokyo 1972-1976], Vol. 21 , No. 1, pp. 5-36\n\nPortuguese: \"Desen volvimento histórico do pensamento europeu\" in Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1934-1950 [Rio de Janeiro, 1934-1950], Vol. 14, No. 24, pp. (275)-294. [2]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1960 [Rio de Janeiro, 1960], Vol. 8, No. 27, pp. 536-555. [3]. \"O pensamento europeu e a sua evolução\" in Obras de Stefan Zweig, 1934-1950 [Porto, 1934-1950], Vol. 21, No. 2, pp. (31)-60\n\nSerbian [Serbo-Croatian] \"Evropska misao u svom istorijskom razvoju\" in Vrijeme i svijet. Sabrani napisi i predavanja 1904-1940, III. No. 20, pp. 279-300\n\nSpanish: \"El pensamiento europeo en su desarrollo histórico\" in [1]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig [Barcelona, 1952-1978] Vol. 4, No. 79, pp. 1032-1048. [2]. Obras de Stefan Zweig [Barcelona/Madrid, 1958], Vol. 2, No. 45, pp. 1018-1035. [3]. Tiempo y mundo [Barcelona, 1952-1978], No. 79, pp. 1032-1048. [4]. \"El desarrollo histórico del pensamiento europeo\" in Tiempo y mundo [Barcelona, 1953], No. 3, pp. 105-156. [5]. El pensamiento europeo en su desarrollo histórico\" in Tiempo y mundo [Barcelona, 1959], No. 19, pp. (205)-223. [6]. [Barcelona, 1998], No. 19, pp. 240-262. [7]. \"El pensamiento europeo en su evolución histórica\" in La Viena de ayer [Buenos Aires/Ciudad de México, 1951], No. 8, pp. (102)-124\n\nSwedish: \"Den europeiska tanken I dess historiska utveckling\" in Tiden och världen. Samlade och föredrag 1904-1940 [Stockholm, 1944], No. 19, pp. 247-270\n\nTurkish: \"Tarihsel gelişimi içínde avrupa düşünü\" in Geleceğe güven. Denemeler 1909-1941 [İstanbul, 2011], No. 23, pp. 111-131",
