      "bibliographicCitation": "[2015]: Kulturverein Landstrich, Brunnenthal\n\nAlfred Kubin - Stefan Zweig. Briefwechsel 1909-1937. Edited by Franz Hamminger and Klemens Renoldner. With an essay by Helga Thieme. Contains 14 illustrations. A photograph of Alfred Kubin, p. (97). 101/(2)p. [LANDSTRICHextra]\n\nContents:\n\nVorwort [Franz Hamminger and Klemens Renoldner], pp. 6-7\nDank [Franz Hamminger and Klemens Renoldner], p. 8\nBriefteil, pp. (10)-(73)\nEditorische Notiz, p. 75\nLiteratur, p. 76\nBildnachweis, p. 77\nEssay [Helga Thieme], pp. 79-101\n\nCorrespondence:\n\n1909\n\nZweig to Kubin, 1 letter, 15 October 1909. Notes, p. 13. Photograph of the handwritten letter, pp. (10)-11\nKubin to Zweig, 1 letter, 27 October 1909, p. 14. Notes, p. 15\n\n1909/1910?\n\nZweig to Kubin, 1 picture postcard, no date, p. 16\n\n1914\n\nKubin to Zweig, 2 postcards, 26 May and 30 May, 1914, p. 17 / 1 letter, 26 June 1914, pp. 18-19. Notes, p. 19\nZweig to Kubin, 1 letter, no date [response to Kubin's letter of 26 June], p. 20. Notes, p. 20\n\n1915\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 29 March 1915, p. 22. Notes, p. 22\n\n1916\n\nZweig to Kubin, 1 postcard, 20 October 1916, p. 23. Notes, p. 23\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 23 October 1916, p. 24. Notes, p. 24\n\n1917\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 letter, 18 September 1917, pp. 25-26. Notes, p. 26\n\n1919\n\nZweig to Kubin, 1 card with his new address in Salzburg, 27 May 1919, p. 27\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 9 July 1919, p. 28. Note, p. 28\n\n1922\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 28 October 1922, p. 29. Notes, p. 30\n\n1924\n\nKubin to Zweig, 2 postcards, 25 February 1924, p. 31. Notes, p. 31 / October/November 1924, p. 32. Notes, p. 33\nZweig to Kubin, 1 postcard, 7 November 1924, p. 34. Notes, p. 35\n\n1925\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 picture postcard, 25 October 1925, p. 35. Notes, p. 36 / 1 letter, 25 April 1925, pp. 36-37. Notes, p. 37\n\n1926\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 letter, 3 September 1926, pp. 38-39. Notes, pp. 39-40\n\n1927\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 4 April 1927,p. 42. Notes, p. 42 / 1 thank you card, 10 April 1927, pp. 44. Photograph of the self-portrait of Kubin on which the note is written, p. (45)\n\n1930\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 postcard, 1 September 1930, p. 46. Notes, p. 46\nKubin to Friderike Zweig, 1 postcard, 1 September 1930, p. 47. Notes, p. 48\n\n1931\n\nKubin to Zweig, 1 letter, 18 February 1931, pp. 49-50. Notes, pp. 50-51\n\n1936\n\nKubin to Zweig, 3 letters, no date [1936], pp. 52-53. Notes, pp. 53-54 / 22 May 1936, pp. 57-58. Notes, p. 58 / 20 October 1936, pp. 59-60. Notes, pp. 62-63\nZweig to Kubin, 2 letters, 4 May 1936, pp. 55-56. Notes, p. 56 / 24 October 1936, p. 64. Notes, p. 64\n\n1937\n\nZweig to Kubin, 2 letters, 26 February, p. 65. Notes, p. 65 / No date [April], pp. 69-70. Note, p. 70\nKubin to Zweig, 1 letter, 24 April, p. 71. Notes, p. 71. Photocopy of the handwritten letter, pp. (72)-(73)",
      "sourceBlobId": 2
    },
