      "bibliographicCitation": "[1960-1961]: Rupa and Company, Kolkata [Calcutta]\n\nGalpa sangraha [Gesammelte Novellen]. Translated from the English by Dipak Chaudhry. Published with the assistance of Richard Friedenthal. 2 vols.\n\nContents: Vol. 1. 1960\n\nAdrishya shilpa [Die unsichtbare Sammlung], pp. 1-17\nGovernace [Die Gouvernante], pp. 18-35\nRacheler abhijog [Rahel rechtet mit Gott], pp. 36-53\nShikar [Sommernovellette], pp. 54-67\nBuchmendel [Buchmendel], pp. 68-101\nHatsaphai [Unvermutete Bekanntschaft mit einem Handwerk], pp. 102-148\nVirat [Die Augen den ewigen Bruders], pp. 149-197\n\nContents: Vol. 2. 1961\n\nKhelar raja dara [Schachnovelle], pp. 1-71\nPalatak [Episode vom Genfer See], pp. 72-82\nAparichitar patra [Der Brief einer Unbekannten], pp. 83-136\nChandralokit kanaguli [Die Mondscheingasse], pp. 137-157\nLeporella [Leporella], pp. 158-186",
