      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1995]: Bayerischer Schulbuchverlag, München\n\nKlaus Langer & Sven Steinberg. \"Die deutsche Literatur im Exil: Stefan Zweig\" in Deutsche Dichtung. Literaturgeschichte in Beispielen für den Deutschunterricht, pp. 286-291. This chapter contains biographical data about and an interpretation of Stefan Zweig's \"Schachnnovelle\". It also contains an excerpt from the novella as well as three photographs - one of Stefan Zweig [ca. 1924], one of Stefan and Lotte Zweig in Petropolis, and one of Curd Jürgens and Mario Adorf from 1960 film of \"Schachnovelle\"",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
