      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Take your pick of plays in Nicosia\" in Cyprus Mail [Nicosia, Cyprus], 27 March 2017. Contains a discussion of Stefan Zweig's Chess Story [Schachnovelle] and notes that the Greek version of the story will be performed as a theatrical adaptation from 26 March until 10 April in the Engomio Cutural Centre, Nicosia. See: http://Cyprus-mail.com/2017/03/25/take-pick-plays-Nicosia/",
