      ],
      "mainCategory": "Symposia and Exhibitions",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Zum 50. Todestag von Stefan Zweig [18 March 1992]. A commemoration and reading organized by the Österreichisches Kulturinstitut and the P.E.N. Zentrum \"German Speaking Writers Abroad\" [London]\n\n\"Aus den Tagebüchern Stefan Zweigs\" . Selections read by Professor Dr. Edward Timms, University of Sussex\nVerwirrung der Gefühle. Selections read by Dr. Dorothea McEwan\nSchachnovelle. Selections read by Peter Comberti",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
