      "locationCreated": {
        "@id": "klawiter:place/Parts%20I%20%26%20II.%20France%2FGermany",
        "@type": "schema:Place",
        "name": "Parts I & II. France/Germany"
      },
      "categories": [
        "Symposia and Exhibitions"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Symposia and Exhibitions",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Die Zeit gibt die Bilder, ich spreche nur die Worte dazu. Stefan Zweig 1881-1942 [20 January-26 March 1993]. An exhibition held in the foyer of the Münchner Stadtbibliothek Am Gasteig. The exhibition was organized by the Kulturzentrum der Israelitischen Kultusgemeinde München and the Münchner Stadtbibliothek am Gasteig. See the catalogue Die Zeit gibt die Bilder, ich spreche nur die Worte dazu - Stefan Zweig 1881-1942\n\nAssociated events:\n\nVolker Michels: \"Im Unrecht nicht selber ungerecht werden! Stefan Zweig und der Nationalsozialismus\". Lecture, 10 February \n\nWolf Euba: \"Stefan Zweig: Meine drei Leben\". A reading from selected works of Zweig by the actor Wolf Euba, 17 March\n \nFilms of Zweig's works shone: 26 January, Brennendes Geheimnis]; 1 February, Beware of Pity; 9 February, Letter from an Unknown Woman; 16 February, Angst; 24 February, Schachnovelle; 9 March, La ruelle au clair de lune; 16 March, Rausch der Verwandlung [Parts I & II. France/Germany, 1986 [I] & 1989 [II], 87 & 88 minutes. Directed by Edouard Molinaro. Starring Vera Tschechowa, Mario Adorf & Kurt Meisel",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
