      "hasPart": [
        "Vorwort [Susanne Bader], p. (1)",
        "Malen mit der Tube & Rötelzeichnerei [Jürgen Brodwolf], p. (3)",
        "24 portrait paintings, pp. (4)-(51)",
        "Legenden, pp. (52)-(53). Stefan Zweig, p. (53)",
        "Impressum, p. (54)"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "[2016]: Buchhandlung zum Wetzstein, Freiburg im Breisgau\n\n\"Stefan Zweig / Malen mit der Tube / Brodwolf 2016\" in Immerwährender Wetzsteinkalender. Edited by Susanne Bader [Buchhandlung zum Wetzstein, Freiburg]. Portrait paintings by Jürgen Brodwolf [Kandern]. Conception of the volume by Susanne Bader, Bernhard Strauss, and Martin Geier. Photographs taken by Bernhard Strauss [Freiburg]. Format of the volume by Martin Geier [Freiburg]. Printed by the Gutenbergdruckerei [Freiburg]. (54)p. 24 portraits [2016] - most of the portraits are red-chalk drawings with tube-painting outlines. Stefan Zweig portrait drawing, p. (47); annotation data, p. (53)\n\nContents:\n\nVorwort [Susanne Bader], p. (1)\nMalen mit der Tube & Rötelzeichnerei [Jürgen Brodwolf], p. (3)\n24 portrait paintings, pp. (4)-(51)\nLegenden, pp. (52)-(53). Stefan Zweig, p. (53)\nImpressum, p. (54)\n\nJürgen Brodwolf's 24 portrait paintngs:\n\nAnnette Kolb [1870-1967], p. (5)\nRené Schickele [1883-1940], p. (7)\nErhart Kästner [1904-1974], pp. (9), (11)\nVirginia Woolf [1882-1941], pp. (13), (15)\nDante Alighieri [1265-1321], p. (17), (19)\nEmmy Ball-Hennings [1885-1948], p. (21), (23)\nFriedrich Schiller [1759-1805], pp. (25), (27)\nHeinrich Heine [1797-1856], pp. (29), (31)\nBettina von Arnim [Brentano] [1785-1859], p. (33)\nJohann Wolfgang von Goethe [1749-1832], p. (35)\nChrista Wolf [1929-2011], p. (37)\nSimone de Beauvoir [1908-1986], p. (39)\nJoseph Eichendorff [1788-1857], p. (41)\nSappho von Lesbos [630-580 BC], p. (43)\nJohann Peter Hebel [1760-182], p. (45)\nStefan Zweig [1881-1942], p. (47)\nRobert Walser [1878-1956], p. (49)\nFreidrich Holderlin [1770-1843], p. (51)",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
