      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"'Unf al-diktātūriyyah\" [The Violence of Dictatorship] in Al-Sharq al-Awsaṭ [The Middle East] [London] No. 12702, 7 September 2013\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation of Stefan Zweig's Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt:\n\nStīfān Zfāyġ. 'Unf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship]. Translated from the German by Fāris Yūwākīm [Fares Youakim]. 223p. Bairut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr wa'l-Tawzī, 2013\n\nThe review is also published online: http://archive.aawsat.com/details.asp?section=19&issueno=12702&article=742608&feature=1#.WjVpw7gtC2B \n\n[2]: \"Die Gewalt der Diktatur\" [Translated from the above Arabic version by Friedhelm Hoffmann], in: Judaica. Beiträge zum Verstehen des Judentums [Zürich: Zürcher Institut für Interreligiösen Dialog (ZIID)], 72:2 [June 2016], pp. 321-322, n. 6",
