      "@id": "klawiter:entry/4183",
      "entryType": "secondary-literature",
      "sourcePageId": 4183,
      "pageNamespace": 0,
      "name": "Nei englesch filmer",
      "sourceTextId": 31511,
      "datePublished": "1946",
      "timePeriod": "post-wwii",
      "numberOfPages": 2,
      "categories": [
        "Secondary Literature / Titles (Luxembourgish)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Nei englesch filmer\" [New English Movies] in D'Unio'n [The Union] [Luxembourg City, Luxembourg], 3:155 [7 September 1946], p. 2. Besides other British film releases, the article announces the release of Beware of Pity [Ungeduld des Herzens] directed by Maurice Elvey, criticizing it for clinging too closely to its original character as a screenplay\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.eluxemburgensia.lu/BnlViewer/view/index.html?lang=de#panel:pp|issue:2335143|article:DTL94|query:Stefan%20Zweig",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
    {
