      ],
      "@id": "klawiter:entry/4184",
      "entryType": "secondary-literature",
      "sourcePageId": 4184,
      "pageNamespace": 0,
      "name": "Ordentlech bicher féhlen an Deitschland",
      "sourceTextId": 31602,
      "datePublished": "1946",
      "timePeriod": "post-wwii",
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "klawiter:publisher/Germany%20Lacks%20Decent%20Books",
        "@type": "schema:Organization",
        "name": "Germany Lacks Decent Books"
      },
      "numberOfPages": 2,
      "categories": [
        "Secondary Literature / Titles (Luxembourgish)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Ordentlech bicher féhlen an Deitschland\" [Germany Lacks Decent Books] in D'Unio'n [The Union] [Luxembourg City, Luxembourg], 3:79 [5 April 1946], p. 2. The article deplores the fact that books proscribed by the Nazis were still not available in post-war Germany, like the works of Erich Maria Remarque, Stefan Zweig, or Jakob Wassermann\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.eluxemburgensia.lu/BnlViewer/view/index.html?lang=de#panel:pp|issue:2333291|article:DTL118|query:Stefan%20Zweig",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
