      "hasPart": [
        "24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. ?",
        "Junūn al-ḥubb [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. ?"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1950]: Manshūrāt al-Baṣrī, Baghdād [Baghdad]\n\n24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. The translator is not indicated. 104p.\n\n[1962]: Dār al-Hilāl, al-Qāhira [Cairo]'\n\n24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]; Junūn al-ḥubb [Brennendes Geheimnis]. 162p. [Riwāyāt al-Hilāl (Al-Hilāl-Novels), 168]\n\nContents:\n\n24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. ?\nJunūn al-ḥubb [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. ?\n\n[2010]: Dār al-Hilāl, al-Qāhira [Cairo]\n\n\"24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah\" [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau] in Junūn al-ḥubb [Love's Madness]. Edited by Maḥmūd Qāsim. 214p. [Riwāyāt al-Hilāl (Al-Hilāl-Novels), 739]\n\nContents:\n\n24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau], pp. 3-108\nJunūn al-ḥubb [Brennendes Geheimnis], pp. 109-212\nMuʾallif al-riwāyah [The Novel's Author. Anonymus [Maḥmūd Qāsim?], pp. 213-214\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alarabimag.com/download/?book=20648\n\n[2012]: Dār al-Madā li-l-Iʿlām waʾl-Ṯaqāfah waʾl-ʿUlūm, Dimashq [Damascus]\n\n24 [Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn] sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. 108p. [Al-Kitāb li-l-jamīʿ (The Book for Everyone)]. Free supplement to the Arab newspapers \"Al-Safîr\" [The Ambassador] (Lebanon), \"Al-Madā\" [The Reach] (Iraq), \"Al-Ittiḥād\" [The Union] (Iraq), \"Al-Bayān\" [The Elucidation] (UAE), \"Al-Qāhirah\" [Cairo] (Egypt), and \"Al-Qabs\" [The Acquisition] (Kuweit).",
      "sourceBlobId": 6
    },
