      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. [2013]: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, Bairūt [Beirut]\n\n\"Hādhā al-kitāb\" [This Book] in ʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship = Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt]. Translated by Fāris Yūwākīm [Fares Youakim]. 1st edition. 223 p. Hādhā al-kitāb, pp. 7-9\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alarabimag.com/download/?book=20702\n\nhttp://alturl.com/woibn\n\n[2]. \"Fāris Yūwākīm fī tarjamat kitāb ʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah li-Stīfān Zfāygh\" [Fares Youakim on the Translation of the Book \"The Violence of Dictatorship\" [= Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt in Jadaliyyah [Dialectics] [Washington, D.C. / Beirut], 2 March 2013. The online magazine Jadaliyyah [Dialectics] is published by the Muʾassasat al-Dirāsāt al-ʿArabiyyah [Arab Studies Institute], Washington, D.C. / Beirut\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://alturl.com/stk8a\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation:\n\nʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship = Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt]. Translated by Fāris Yūwākīm [Fares Youakim]. 223p. 1st edition. Beirut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, 2013\n\n[3]. \"ʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah» kamā raʾāhā Stīfān Zfāygh\" [The Violence of Dictatorship, as Stefan Zweig Saw It] in Al-Ḥayāt [The Life] [London], 03 March 2013. Al-Ḥayāt [The Life] is an international Arab daily published in London\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alhayat.com/Details/488832\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation:\n\nʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship = Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt]. Translated by Fāris Yūwākīm [Fares Youakim]. 223p. 1st edition. Beirut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, 2013",
