      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Raffī: li-mutʿat al-qirāʾah\" [My Bookshelf. For the Pleasure of Reading] is an Arabic blog about Zweig's works. \"Raffī\" provides short descriptions of seventeen Arabic translations of Stefan Zweig's works, plus entire reviews of three of them. See:\n\nhttp://raffy.ws/author/2495/%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B2%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%BA",
