      "decomposedAsWork": "klawiter:work/4445",
      "bibliographicCitation": "German\n\n[2000]: Hochschulverl., Freiburg im Breisgau\n\nFrauen- und Männerbilder in den Novellen von Stefan Zweig. 168p. [Hochschulsammlung Philosophie. Literaturwissenschaft, 16]. This volume was originally the author's 1999 PhD thesis at the Albert-Ludwigs-Universität, Freiburg im Breisgau\n\nArabic\n\n[2015]\n\n\"Ṣūrat al-marʾah waʾl-rajul fī uqṣūṣat Stīfān Tsfāygh 'Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah'\" [The Image of Woman and Man in Stefan Zweig's Novel 'Twenty-four Hours in the Life of a Woman'] in Al-Balāghah waʾl-naqd al-ʿarabī [Arabic Rhetoric and Criticism] [Rabat], 3 [2015], pp. 71-79\n\nPublished online [shortened preview version]:\n\nhttp://platform.almanhal.com/Article/Preview.aspx?ID=60445",
