      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Baḥthan ʿan sirr intiḥār Stīfān Tsfāygh maʿa zawjatihī\" [In Search of the Mystery Why Stefan Zweig, Together with His Wife, Committed Suicide], in: Al-Ḥayāt [The Life] [International print edition] [London], ?? [09 June 2014], p. ??\n\nPublished online\n\nhttp://www.alhayat.com/Articles/2856610/%D8%A8%D8%AD%D8%AB%D8%A7%D9%8B-%D8%B9%D9%86-%D8%B3%D8%B1-%D8%A7%D9%86%D8%AA%D8%AD%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%AA%D8%B3%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%BA-%D9%85%D8%B9-%D8%B2%D9%88%D8%AC%D8%AA%D9%87\n\nThis is a review of George Prochnik’s biography The Impossible Exile. Stefan Zweig at the End of the World. New York: Other Press, 2014",
