      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stīfān Zfāygh... wadāʿ Ūrūbā\" [Stefan Zweig... the Farewell from Europe] in Al-Mudun: Jarīdah Iliktrūniyyah Mustaqillah [The Cities: Independent Electronical Newspaper] [Beirut?], 13 July 2016\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.almodon.com/culture/2016/7/13/%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B2%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%BA-%D9%88%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B9-%D8%A3%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A7\n\nThis is a film review of the English version \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz.",
