      "bibliographicCitation": "[1988]: Production Générale de Films (PROGÉFI), Paris: Rai Due, Roma; Zweites Deutsches Fernsehen, Mainz; Österreichischer Rundfunk, Wien, et al.\n\nRausch der Verwandlung [A color TV mini-series (2 episodes) based on Stefan Zweig's unpublished novel \"Rausch der Verwandlung\"]\n\nLanguages: Available in French, German, and Italian\nDirector: Édouard Molinaro\nProducer: Christine Gouze-Rénal\nScript writers: Christine Miller (dialogue) and Édouard Molinaro\nCast: Mario Adorf, Catherine Arditi, Evelyne Bouix, Jan Hartl, Tobias Hoesl et al.\nMusic by: Michael Kocáb\nCinematographer: Michael Epp\nRuntime: Not indicated\nReleased in France on 20 February 1989 as L'Ivresse de la métamorphose; released in Germany on 2 May 1988 and Austria on 28 May 1988 as Rausch der Verwandlung; released in Italy as L'Ebbrezza della metamorfosi\nReleased as a DVD film [in German and Italian] by the Alive Vertrieb AG, Köln on 18 September 2014. Runtime: 3 hours and 4 minutes\nReleased as a DVD film in France on 25 January 2016. See: Stefan Zweig au cinéma - 4 DVD",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
