      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stīfān Zfāygh.. taʿriyat al-nafs al-bashariyyah ʿalā ruqʿat shaṭranj\" [Stefan Zweig... the Uncovering of the Human Psyche on a Chessboard] in ultraṣawt [s.l.], 04 August 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.ultrasawt.com/%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B2%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%BA-%D8%AA%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%86%D9%81%D8%B3-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%B4%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89-%D8%B1%D9%82%D8%B9%D8%A9-%D8%B4%D8%B7%D8%B1%D9%86%D8%AC/%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%A6%D9%84-%D9%82%D9%8A%D8%B3/%D8%A3%D8%AF%D8%A8/%D8%AB%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%A9\n\nThis article contains two reviews: [1] a film review of the English version \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, and [2] a review of Saḥar Sattālah's recent Arabic translation \"Lāʿib al-shaṭranj\" of Stefan Zweig's \"Schachnovelle\":\n\nLāʿib al-shaṭranj [Schachnovelle]. Translated by Saḥar Sattālah. 78p. Tunis: Maskīliyānā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masciliana Editions], 2017",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
