        "@type": "schema:Organization",
        "name": "articles and poems"
      },
      "locationCreated": {
        "@id": "klawiter:place/Iraq",
        "@type": "schema:Place",
        "name": "Iraq"
      },
      "inLanguage": "ar",
      "languageName": "Arabic",
      "categories": [
        "Secondary Literature / Authors (Arabic)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" [Brief einer Unbekannten] in Kuttāb al-ʿIrāq: minbar al-kātib al-ʿirāqī / IraqWriters.com [The Writers of Iraq: The Pulpit of the Iraqi Writer] [Iraq], No. ? [20 October 2010], p. ?\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.iraqiwriters.com/INP/view.asp?ID=2573\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation \"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" of Stefan Zweig's \"Brief einer Unbekannten\". Although the reviewer mentions that, back in the 1960s, he read a translation by Muḥammad Quṭb, he does not make it clear on which of the different Arabic translations his present review is based. \"Kuttāb al-ʿIrāq: minbar al-kātib al-ʿirāqī / IraqWriters.com\" is an Iraqi online community offering Iraqi authors a platform for publishing articles and poems",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
