      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Riwāyat «Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah» li-Istīfān Zfāygh : al-tajribah al-ḥayātiyyah fī ʿayn al-ākhar\" [Stefan Zweig's Novel \"Twenty-four Hours in the Life of a Woman\". The Life Experiment in the Eyes of the Other] in Al-Quds al-ʿarabī [The Arab Jerusalem] [London] No. ? [19 July 2017], p. ??. Published by Muʾassasat al-Quds al-ʿArabī li-l-Nashr waʾl-Iʿlān [Al-Quds Al-Arabi Publishing and Advertising (Overseas) Ltd], Landan [London]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alquds.co.uk/?p=755768\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation\n\nArbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. Translated by al-Asʿad ibn Ḥusayn [Lassaad Ben Hsin]. Proofread and edited by Aḥmad Shākir ibn Ḍayyah. 105p. First edition. Tunis: Maskīliyānā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masciliana Editions] / Ottawa, ON: Masʿā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masaa Publishing & Distribution], 2017\n\n[2]. \"Hîva Nebi's Reviews: Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah\" [Hîva Nebi's Reviews: Twenty-four Hours in the Life of a Woman (Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau)] in Goodreads [San Francisco], 1 August 2017\n\nReprint of the preceding review [1]. \"Goodreads\" is a social cataloging website for books, which is owned by \"Amazon.com, Inc.\"\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2079108739?book_show_action=false&from_review_page=9\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation\n\nArbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. Translated by al-Asʿad ibn Ḥusayn [Lassaad Ben Hsin]. Proofread and edited by Aḥmad Shākir ibn Ḍayyah. 105p. First edition. Tunis: Maskīliyānā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masciliana Editions] / Ottawa, ON: Masʿā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masaa Publishing & Distribution], 2017\n\n[3]. \"Hîva Soro's Reviews: Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah fī ḥayāt imraʾah\" [Hîva Soro's Reviews: Twenty-four Hours in the Life of a Woman (Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau)] in Goodreads [San Francisco], 9 January 2018\n\nGoodreads is a social cataloging website for books, which is owned by \"Amazon.com, Inc.\"\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2251090699?book_show_action=false&from_review_page=9\n\nAlthough giving the title of a 2012 edition, this is a review of the Arabic translation\n\nArbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah [Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau]. Translated by al-Asʿad ibn Ḥusayn [Lassaad Ben Hsin]. Proofread and edited by Aḥmad Shākir ibn Ḍayyah. 105p. First edition. Tunis: Maskīliyānā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masciliana Editions] / Ottawa, ON: Masʿā li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ [Masaa Publishing & Distribution], 2017",
