      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Al-Nimsāwī Stīfān Zfāygh fī ḥikāyatihī al-ūrūbiyyah: iḥbāṭ al-manfā [The Austrian Stefan Zweig in His European Story: the Frustration of Exile] in Al-Quds al-ʿarabī [The Arab Jerusalem] [London] No. ? [20 February 2016], p. ??. Published by Muʾassasat al-Quds al-ʿArabī li-l-Nashr waʾl-Iʿlān [Al-Quds Al-Arabi Publishing and Advertising (Overseas) Ltd], Landan [London]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alquds.co.uk/?p=485475\n\nOn the same day republished in the Jordanian website Raṣīn [Rasseen /Serious]:\n\n\"Al-Nimsāwī Stīfān Zfāygh fī ḥikāyatihī al-ūrūbiyyah: iḥbāṭ al-manfā [The Austrian Stefan Zweig in His European Story: the Frustration of Exile] in Raṣīn [Rasseen / Serious] [Amman], 20 February 2016. \"Raṣīn / Rasseen\" [Serious] is a Jordanian website published by the Markaz Awān li-l-Istishārāt al-Iʿlāmiyyah al-ʿArabiyyah [Amman]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://rasseen.com/art.php?id=515878804dff2ef48aeae7a6e5dfb62916d03c90\n\nThis is a review of the documentary film \"Stefan Zweig, histoire d’un Européen / Ein Europäer von Welt\", directed by Jean-Pierre Devillers and François Busnel and produced on behalf of the joint French-German TV network ARTE (Association relative à la télévision européenne), headquartered in Strasbourg, which was broadcasted on the 6th of January 2016 at 22h35. See:\n\nhttp://9docu.com/regarder-et-telecharger-le-documentaire-stefan-zweig-histoire-d-un-europeen-gratuitement/ [documentation in French]\n\nhttp://www.tv-replay.fr/redirection/29-11-17/stefan-zweig-histoire-d-un-europeen-arte-12701516.html [video in French]\n\nhttp://programm.ard.de/TV/Themenschwerpunkte/Musik-und-Kultur/Literatur/Startseite/?sendung=2872416415963606 [announcement in German]\n\nhttps://www.arte.tv/de/videos/050576-000-A/stefan-zweig/ [video in German]\n\n[2]. \"Sinīn [sic] al-manfā al-akhīrah li-l-kātib al-nimsāwī fī ʾl-Barāzīl : al-fīlm al-almānī «Stīfān Zfāygh: wadāʿan Ūrūbā»\" [Stefan Zweig's Last Years of Exile in Brazil. The German Movie \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\"] in Al-Quds al-ʿarabī [The Arab Jerusalem] [London] No. ? [16 August 2016], p. ??\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alquds.co.uk/?p=582305\n\nThis is a review of the English film version \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz. The reviewer republished exactly the same text on his private blog \"Salīm al-Bīk - kātib filasṭīnī min Sūriyā, riwāʾī wa-muḥarrir thaqāfī\" [Saleem Albeik - Palestinian Writer from Syria, Novelist and Feuilleton Editor], as shown below\n\n[3]. \"Stīfān Zfāygh: wadāʿan Ūrūbā» li-l-almāniyyah Māriyā Shrādir\" [\"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" by the German Maria Schrader] in the blog Salīm al-Bīk - kātib filasṭīnī min Sūriyā, riwāʾī wa-muḥarrir thaqāfī [Saleem Albeik - Palestinian Writer from Syria, Novelist and Feuilleton Editor] [Toulouse] [17 August 2016]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://saleemalbeik.wordpress.com/2016/08/17/stefanzweigfarewelltoeurope/\n\nThis is a review of the English film version \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz. The original review was published the day before in the pan-Arab daily Al-Quds al-ʿarabī [The Arab Jerusalem] [London], as shown above",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
