      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Sīrat ḥayāt\" [A Life Story]. Translated by al-Madā [actually by Ibtisām ʿAbdallāh] in Al-Madā [The Reach], [Baghdad], No. 4003 [23 August 2017], pp. ??\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.almadapaper.net/ar/news/535001/%D8%B3%D9%8A%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%AD%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%A9\n\nThis is a slightly modified anonymous translation of Duncan Fallowell's review \"Three Lives. A Biography of Stefan Zweig by Oliver Matuschek\" in The Telegraph [London], 6 January 2012, pp. ??\n\nSee: http://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/books/bookreviews/8995690/Three-Lives-a-Biography-of-StefanZweig-by-Oliver-Matuschek-review.html",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
