      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Bunāt al-ʿālam\" [The Master Builders of the World] in Awrāq [Papers] [Baghdad], 16 April 2011, pp. ??. Awrāq [Papers] is a weekly cultural supplement to the Iraqi daily Al-Madā [The Reach]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=1833#sthash.U40DXBoN.dpbs\n\nhttp://almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=1833&spell=0&highlight=%C8%E4%C7%C9+%C7%E1%DA%C7%E1%E3#sthash.7D7h2g9F.dpbs\n\nLater republished in another cultural supplement to the same Iraqi daily:\n\n\"Bunāt al-ʿālam\" [The Master Builders of the World] in Manārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] [Baghdad], Vol. 9: No. 2477 [9 May 2012], Stefan Zweig, pp. 8-9\n\nManārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] is a weekly cultural supplement to the Iraqi daily Al-Madā [The Reach]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.almadasupplements.com/pdf/05-2477/21.pdf\n\nhttp://almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=4603#sthash.kFaufodQ.Vm2pIJ4o.dpbs\n\nhttp://almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=4603&spell=0&highlight=%C8%E4%C7%C9+%C7%E1%DA%C7%E1%E3#sthash.KkwccHiu.dpbs\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation\n\nBunāt al-ʿālam [Baumeister der Welt]. 2 vols. Translated by Muḥammad Jadīd [Mouhammed Jadid]. 306 +306p. 1st edition. Damascus: Wizārat al-Thaqāfah [Ministry of Culture], 1970. 399p. 2nd edition (Vol. 1). Damascus: Wizārat al-Thaqāfah [Ministry of Culture], 1993. 331 + 404p. 3rd edition. Beirut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, 2003",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
