      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Sāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah\" [Decisive Moments in the History of Mankind] in Al-Iqtiṣādiyyah : jarīdat al-ʿarab al-iqtiṣādiyyah al-duwaliyyah / Al-Eqtisadiah [The Economical. The International Economical Newspaper of the Arabs] [Riyadh/London], 26 February 2009. \"Al-Iqtiṣādiyyah [The Economical] is an electronic daily newspaper\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.aleqt.com/2009/02/26/article_199759.html\n\nLater republished without indication of the original source:\n\n\"Sāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah\" [Decisive Moments in the History of Mankind] in Manārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] [Baghdad], Vol. 9: No. 2477 [9 May 2012], Stefan Zweig, p. 7. Manārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] is a weekly cultural supplement to the Iraqi daily Al-Madā [The Reach]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.almadasupplements.com/pdf/05-2477/21.pdf\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation Sāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah: arbaʿ ʿashra ṣūrah tārīkhiyyah wajīzah [Sternstunden der Menschheit. Vierzehn historische Miniaturen]. Translated by Muḥammad Jadīd [Mouhammad Jadid]. 367p. 1st edition. Beirut/Damascus: Dār al-Madā li-l-Thaqāfah\n\n[2]. \"Sāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah\" [Fateful Moments in the History of Mankind] in Al-Waṭan ūn lāyn [\"The Fatherland\" Online] [Abha], 04 May 2010. Al-Waṭan ūn lāyn [\"The Fatherland\" Online] is the online edition of the Saudi daily Al-Waṭan [The Fatherland], Abhā [Abha]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.alwatan.com.sa/Articles/Detail.aspx?ArticleId=89\n\nThis is a review of two Arabic translations: [1]. \"Mājillān. Qāhir al-biḥār\" [Magellan. Der Mann und seine Tat] and [2]. \"Sāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah: arbaʿ ʿashra ṣūrah tārīkhiyyah wajīzah\" [Sternstunden der Menschheit. Vierzehn historische Miniaturen]. The reviewer does not give any further details on the exact editions on which his reviews are based",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
