      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Qirāʾah fī kitāb: Stīfān Zfāyj.. ʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah\" [A Review of the Book - Stefan Zweig: \"The Violence of Dictatorship\"] in Al-Waṭan [The Fatherland] [Algeria] 20 June 2013\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.elwatandz.com/culture/8815.html\n\nThis is a review of:\n \nʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship = Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt]. Translated by Fāris Yūwākīm [Fares Youakim]. 223p. 1st edition. Beirut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, 2013",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
