      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Al-Bunāt al-ʿiẓām fī ʿālam al-riwāyah waʾl-fann\" [The Master Builders in the World of Novel and Art] in Tajalliyāt [Manifestations] [s.l.], 03 October 2011\n\n\"Tajalliyāt\" [Manifestations] is an Arab web forum\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.taglyat.com/vb/showthread.php?t=11878\n\n[2]. \"Līnīn fī Sāʿāt al-qadar li-Stīfān Tsfāyj\" [Lenin in Stefan Zweig's \"Decisive Moments\"] in Manārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] [Baghdad], Vol. 10: No. 2780 [24 April 2013], Flādīmīr Līnīn [Vladimir Lenin], p. 10\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.almadasupplements.com/pdf/04-2780/21.pdf\n\nhttp://www.almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=7325&spell=0&highlight=%D3%CA%ED%DD%C7%E4#sthash.Bk6Youd1.5fIGeo87.dpbs\n\nThis is a review of the essay \"Al-Qiṭār al-makhtūm : Līnīn, 9 nīsān 1917\" [Der versiegelte Zug. Lenin, 9. April 1917]\" which is contained in the Arabic translation of Sternstunden der Menschheit. Vierzehn historische Miniaturen:\n\nSāʿāt al-qadar fī tārīkh al-bashariyyah: arbaʿ ʿashra ṣūrah tārīkhiyyah wajīzah [Sternstunden der Menschheit. Vierzehn historische Miniaturen]. Translated by Muḥammad Jadīd [Mouhammad Jadid]. 367p. 1st edition. Beirut/Damascus: Dār al-Madā li-l-Thaqāfah wa'l-Nashr [Al Mada Publishing Company], 2005, pp. 289-303",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
