      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Joseph Roth: A Life in Letters by Michael Hofmann\" in The Guardian [London] No. ?? [24 February 2012], pp. ??\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.theguardian.com/books/2012/feb/24/joseph-roth-letters-michael-hofmann\n\nThis is a review of Joseph Roth: A Life in Letters. Translated and edited by Michael Hofmann. London: Granta, 2012\n\nTranslation into Arabic:\n\n\"Ḥayāt fī rasāʾil Jūzīf Rūth.. Stīfān Zfāyj wa-ākharūn\" [A Life in the Letters of Joseph Roth: Stefan Zweig and Others]. Translated from English by ʿAbbās al-Mufrijī, in Manārāt [Manarat / Lighthouses] [Baghdad], Vol. 9: No. 2477 [9 May 2012]: Stefan Zweig, p. 13\n\nSee: \n\nhttp://www.almadasupplements.com/pdf/05-2477/21.pdf and http://almadasupplements.com/news.php?action=view&id=4598#sthash.gTHXawUH.dpbs. Anonymous re-edition",
