      "bibliographicCitation": "[1988]: B. A. Produktion GmbH, München; Bayerischer Rundfunk (BR), München; C.L.G. Films, London\n\nBurning Secret [A color film drama based on Stefan Zweig's novella \"Brennendes Geheimnis\"]\n\nLanguage: English\nDirector: Andrew Birkin\nProducer: Carol Lynn Greene\nFilm editor: Paul Greene\nScript writer: Andrew Birkin \nCast: Klaus Maria Brandauer, Faye Dunaway, David Eberts, Ian Richardson, John Nettleton et al.\nMusic by: Hans Zimmer\nCinematographer: Ernest Day\nRuntime: 1 hour and 46 minutes\nReleased in the United States on 23 December 1988\n\nSee also:\n\nAbrams, Nathan. \"Rediscovered Stanley Kubrick Script Sheds Light On His Jewishness [Stanley Kubrick's Lost Stefan Zweig Script]\" in The Forward [New York], 16 July 2018. See: https://forward.com/culture/film-tv/405685/rediscovered-stanley-kubrick-script-sheds-light-on-his-Jewishness/\nAlberge, Dalya. \"Lost Stanley Kubrick screenplay, Burning Secret, is found 60 years on\" in The Guardian [London], 15 July 2018. See: https://www.theguardian.com/film/2018/jul/15/stanley-kubrick-lost-screenplay-burning-secret-found\nHartman, Jan. \"In Wales, Found The Lost Script Of Stanley Kubrick\" in The Siver Telegram[Toronto, Canada], 17 July 2018. See: https://sivtelegram.media/in-wales-found-the-lost-script-of-stanley-kubrick/32179/\nKatz, Brigit. \"Professor Discovers 'Lost' Stanley Kubrick Screenplay\" in SamrtNews [Washington, D. C.], 18 July 2018. See: https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/professor-discovers-lost-stanley-kubrick-screenplay-180969660\nMcDonald, Hannah. \"60 Years Later, a Lost Stanley Kubrick Script Has Been Found\" in Mental Floss [New York], 16 July 2018. See: http://mentalfloss.com/article/551175/stanley-kubrick-lost-script-found-burning-secret-lolita",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
