      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Kāzānūfā wa-Jūtah wa-mutʿat al-qirāʾah : Jūtah wa-Rūsū wa-man ilayhimā fī naẓar Zfāyj, nāshiʾūn wa-huwāt ṣighār, wa-mubtadiʾūn fī ʿālam al-ḥubb, kamā anna Kāzānūfā hāwin wa-mubtadiʾ fī ʿālam al-adab.\" [Casanova and Goethe and the Pleasure of Reading. In Zweig's View, Goethe, Rousseau and People like Them Are Juniors, Little Amateurs and Beginners in the World of Love, Just As Casanova Is an Amateur and Beginner in the World of Literature] in Mīdil Īst Ūnlāyn [Middle East Online], [London], 7 June 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://middle-east-online.com/?id=250027\n\nThis is a review of \"Casanova\" in \"Drei Dichter ihres Lebens\". The reviewer does not indicate whether his review is based on an English or an Arabic translation",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
