      "bibliographicCitation": "[1988]: Théâtre de la Gaîté-Montparnasse, Paris\n\nNocturnes [A stage production based upon Stefan Zweig's novellas \"Amok\" [Der Amoklaufer] and \"Lettre d'une inconnue\" [Brief einer Unbekannten\n\nLanguage: French\nStage adaptation by: Jacques Weber\nProducers: Serge Marzolff and Jacques Weber\nCast: Jacques Weber, Dominique Regnier, Luc Alexander et al.\nCinematographer: Serge Marzolff\nCostumes by: Jacques Schmift and Emmanuel Peduzzi\nPremiere: Paris on 13 September 1988\nAlso staged in the Théâtre de Nice, Nice, in 1989",
