      "categories": [
        "Secondary Literature / Titles (Arabic)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Majālis al-kitāb bi-Nābil.. mauʿid shahrī li-taqdīm al-iṣdārāt al-jadīdah\" [The 'Conseils du livre' in Nabeul... a Monthly Meeting for the Presentation of New Releases] in Al-Shurūq [Al Chourouk / The Sunrise] [Tunis], [20 October 2017 ?], pp. ??.\n\nِAmong other new releases, the \"Conseils du livre\" in Nabeul in Tunisia announces here, in the presence of the translator al-Asʿad ibn Ḥusayn [Lassaad Ben Hsin], the latter's new Arabic translation \"Arbaʿ wa-ʿishrūn sāʿah min ḥayāt imraʾah\" [Tunis: Masciliana Editions / Ottawa, ON: Masaa Publishing & Distribution, 2017] of Stefan Zweig's \"Vierundzwanzig Stunden aus dem Leben einer Frau\"\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://alturl.com/c3bm2",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
