      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Al-Muthaqqaf al-ʿarabī.. kathīr min al-īrāzmiyyah qalīl min al-lūthariyyah [The Arab Intellectual... a Lot of Erasmianism, a Bit of Lutheranism!] in Al-ʿArabī al-jadīd [The New Arab] [London], 18 November 2017, pp. ??\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://alturl.com/ff454\n\nhttp://alturl.com/rnwsj\n\nBased on Fāris Yūwākīm's [Fares Youakim] recent Arabic translation of Stefan Zweig's Castellio gegen Calvin oder Ein Gewissen gegen die Gewalt. The Arabic version: ʿUnf al-diktātūriyyah [The Violence of Dictatorship]. Beirut: Dār al-Furāt li-l-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, 2013. The Moroccan writer Rashīd Bū-Ṭayyib [Rachid Boutayeb] pleads for more independence of Arab intellectuals from politics and politicians",
