      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Zweig: The World of Yesterday\" in litnet [Stellenbosch], 18 June 2013\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.litnet.co.za/stefan-zweig-the-world-of-yesterday/\n\nThis is a review of Benjamin W. Huebsch's and Helmut Ripperger's English translation The World of Yesterday. An Autobiography of Stefan Zweig's autobiography Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers. While the English translation originally was published in 1943 by Cassel and Company Limited in London, the reviewer does not indicate whether his review is based on the original edition or on one of the many subsequent editions",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
