      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Bi-ṣadad kitāb (Lāʿib al-shaṭranj) ... li-l-kātib al-nimsāwī al-shahīr Istīfān Zfāygh [Concerning the Book \"The Royal Game\" by the Famous Austrian Author Stefan Zweig] in Al-Waḥdah [The Unity] [Lattakia], No. 8644 [5 May 2016], pp. ??\n\nThe Syrian daily Al-Waḥdah [The Unity] is published by the Muʾassasat al-Waḥdah li-l-Ṣaḥāfah waʾl-Ṭibāʿah waʾl-Nashr waʾl-Tawzīʿ, Lattakia\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://wehda.alwehda.gov.sy/node/405606\n\nThis is a review of Yaḥyā Ḥaqqī's Arabic translation Lāʿib al-shaṭranj of Schachnovelle. The Syrian journalist reviews Ḥaqqī's translation on the basis of a supplement to the Syrian magazine \"Al-Maʿrifah. Majallah thaqafiyyah shahriyyah\" [Al-Marifa / The Knowledge. A Monthly Cultural Magazine], [Damascus] Vol. 55 No. 630 [20 March 2016], which is printed at the end of the issue under the heading \"Kitāb al-shahr: Lāʿib al-shaṭranj\" [The Book of the Month: \"The Royal Game\"], without indicating the exact page numbers",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
