      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Ḥabīb Jāmātī\" in Al-Sīnimā.kūm [elcinema.com / The_Cinema.com], [Cairo] [no date]\n\n\"Al-Sīnimā.kūm\" [elcinema.com / The_Cinema.com] is an Egyptian webpage dedicated to the international, Arab, and Egyptian cinema\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.elcinema.com/person/1066434/\n\nThis is a CV of the Egyptian journalist, novelist, historian and Arabic translator Ḥabīb Jāmātī, whose translation Mājillān. Qāhir al-biḥār [Magellan. Der Mann und seine Tat] first appeared in 1951 with the Cairene publishing house Dār al-Hilāl and subsequently was republished several times",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
    {
      "@type": [
        "schema:ScholarlyArticle",
        "klawiter:SecondaryLiteratureEntry"
      ],
      "@id": "klawiter:entry/4919",
