      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Mājillān.. qāhir al-biḥār : qaraʾtu hādhihī al-maʿlūmāt fa-aḥbabtu an nastafīda minhā maʿan : tafaḍḍalū mashkūrīn [Magellan, Conqueror of the Seas: I Had Read These Facts, So I Wanted Them to Benefit All of Us. Please, with Thanks!] in Al-Manā waʾl-arab [Destiny and Desire], [s.l.] 1 November 2009\n\nAl-Manā waʾl-arab [Destiny and Desire]\" is an Arabic webforum\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.arabna312.com/vb/showthread.php?t=404\n\nThis is a review of Magellan. Der Mann und seine Tat based on one of the several editions of Ḥabīb Jāmātī's Arabic translation of this volume",
