      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Mājillān qāhir al-biḥār : qirāʾah li-kitāb (Mājillān qāhir al-biḥār) li-Stīfān Zfāyj\" [Magellan, Conqueror of the Seas: Review of Stefan Zweig's Book \"Magellan, Conqueror of the Seas\"] in Shabakat afiyāʾ al-thaqāfiyyah [afeaa.com / \"Shadows\". A Cultural Network] [s.l.], 23 December 2012\n\nShabakat afiyāʾ al-thaqāfiyyah [afeaa.com / \"Shadows\". A Cultural Network] is an Arabic webforum\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.afeaa.com/vb/showthread.php?t=3751\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation:\n\nMājillān. Qāhir al-biḥār awwal man ṭāfa ḥawla ʾl-ʿālam waʾrtāda al-muḥīṭāt al-shāsiʿah [Magellan. Der Mann und seine Tat]. Translated by Ḥabīb Jāmātī. 143p. Damascus: Dār al-Madā li-l-Thaqāfah waʾl-Nashr, 2008",
