      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"El mundo de ayer. Memorias de un europeo. Stefan Zweig\" in Miraflores Oleiros [pseudonym]: Biblioteca Miraflores [Miraflores Library] [Oleiros, A Coruña], 30 May 2013\n\nBiblioteca Miraflores [Miraflores Library] is a blog published by the highschool \"Instituto de Educación Secundaria Ies Miraflores\" in Oleiros in the North-West Spanish province of La Coruña (\"A Coruña\" in Galician)\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://bibliotecaiesmiraflores.blogspot.de/2013/05/el-mundo-de-ayer-memorias-de-un-europeo.html\n\nThis is a review in Galician of the Spanish translation\n\nEl Mundo de ayer. Memorias de un Europeo [Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers]. Translated by J. Fontcuberta and A. Orzeszek. Barcelona: Acantilado / Quaderns Crema, 2001. 17th reprint 2013",
