      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"O gran hotel Budapest\" [The Grand Budapest Hotel] in Café Barbantia. Un lugar para a conversa [Café Barbantia. A Place for Conversation] [A Coruña], 27 April 2014\n\nCafé Barbantia is a web forum for literature and the arts, subsidized by the \"Deputación da Coruña\", A Coruña [La Coruña]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://cafebarbantia.barbantia.es/?p=1179\n\nThis is a review of the British-German dramatic-comedy film The Grand Budapest Hotel [2014], written and directed by Wes Anderson, and based on several of Stefan Zweig's works",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
