      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Al-Aḥmaq.. al-lāʿib.. al-mamsūs.. ṣīghat al-tamarrud ʿinda Dūstuwifskī\" [The Dumb... the Player... the Insane... the Form of Insubordination in Dostoyevsky's Oeuvre] in Al-Thawrah : yawmiyyah siyāsiyyah [The Revolution. A Political Daily] [Damascus], 26 December 2007, pp. ??\n\nThe Syrian daily Al-Thawrah : yawmiyyah siyāsiyyah [The Revolution. A Political Daily] is published by the Muʾassasat al-Waḥdah li-l-Ṣaḥāfah waʾl-Ṭibāʿah waʾl-Nashr, Damascus\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://thawra.sy/_print_veiw.asp?FileName=13668538920071225222131\n\nThis is a review of the Arabic translation of \"Dostojewski\":\n\nDustuwifskī: naqd wa-dirāsah. Translated by Farīd Anṭūniyūs. 160p. Damascus: Wizārat al-Thaqāfah, al-Hayʾah al-ʿĀmmah al-Sūriyyah li-l-Kitāb [Ministry of Culture, The Syrian General Organization of Books], 2007",
