      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Zweig endar Filmsdagarnar\" [Stefan Zweig Closes the Film Days] in birk. Birgir Kruse bloggar um miðlar, mentan og annað mangt [birk. Birgir Kruse, the Blog about Media, Culture and Much More] [Tórshavn], 24 September 2017\n\nbirk. Birgir Kruse bloggar um miðlar, mentan og annað mangt [birk. Birgir Kruse, the Blog about Media, Culture and Much More] is a blog by the Faeroese teacher and diploma educationalist Birgir Kruse from Tórshavn, the capital of the Faeroe Islands\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://birkblog.blogspot.de/2017/09/stefan-zweig-endar-filmsdagarnar.html\n\nhttp://birkblog.blogspot.de/2017/09/\n\nThis is a review of the German, French, and Austrian movie Vor der Morgenröte - Stefan Zweig in Amerika (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, and of Knút Olsen's Faeroese translation Heimurin, ið var: endurminningar hjá einum evropeara [Vestmanna: Sprotin, 2017] of the Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers",
