      "bibliographicCitation": "[1938]: Petit St. Hubert bij de Witte Brug, Scheveningen, Netherlands\n\nJeremia [A stage play based on Stefan Zweig's Jeremias. Eine dramatische Dichtung in neun Bildern]. Staged by Abraham van der Vies at the \"Petit St. Hubert bij de Witte Brug\" in Scheveningen, 9 & 10 July 1938 at 10 pm. Adapted by Halbo C. Kool. Music by Robert de Roos. 150 performers from the Vrijzinnig Christelijke Jeugdcentrale, Utrecht\n\nThe original poster for the play is published online:\n\nhttp://www.geheugenvannederland.nl/nl/geheugen/view?coll=ngvn&identifier=KONB16%3A84382899\n\nNewspaper ads:\n\n\"Openluchtvoorstellingen: Jeremia. Stefan Zweig.\" [Open-air Performances: Jeremias. Stefan Zweig] in Leidsch Dagblad [Leiden Daily] [Leiden], Vol. 79 No. 24011 [7 July 1938], pp. 4 & 8\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://leiden.courant.nu/issue/LD/1938-07-07/edition/0/page/4\n\nhttp://leiden.courant.nu/issue/LD/1938-07-04/edition/0/page/8",
      "sourceBlobId": 3
    },
