      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Dve dramatizácie. Svetová próza vo vysielaní rozhlasu\" [Two Dramatizations. The World of Prose in Radio Broadcasting] in Práca [Labour] [Bratislava], Vol. 34, No. 274 [20 November 1979], p. 6\n\nAccording to the Slovak Union Catalogue this is an article about two dramatizations, one of a work by Stefan Zweig and one of a work by Franz Werfel. The catalogue, however, does not mention the titles of the works dramatized and broadcasted by the Czechoslovakian Broadcasting Company.",
