      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "M., K. [Marshaliyān, Kūlīt / Marshalian, Colette ?]\n\n\"Riwāyat Stīfān Zfaygh «Safar ilā ʾl-māḍī\" ilā ʾl-sīnimā min ikhrāj faransī [Stefan Zweig's Novel \"Journey into the Past\" for the Cinema in a French Production] in Al-Mustaqbal [The Future] [Beirut], No. ?? [30 April 2011], p. ?\n\nThe Lebanese daily \"Al-Mustaqbal\" [The Future] is published by al-Sharikah al-ʿArabiyyah al-Muttaḥidah li-l-Ṣaḥāfah [Arab United Press], Beirut\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://almustaqbal.com/article/461871/\n\nThis is a pre-announcement of the French-Belgian romance film \"Une promesse\" (2013), directed by Patrice Leconte and written by Patrice Leconte and Jérôme Tonnerre, starring Rebecca Hall, Alan Rickman, Richard Madden, and Maggie Steed, and based on Stefan Zweig's novella \"Widerstand der Wirklichkeit / Die Reise in die Vergangenheit\"",
