      "mainCategory": "Historical Studies",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[2003]: Uegen, Tiranë [Tirana]\n\nLegjenda dhe portrete [Legends and Portraits]. Translated by Jorgji Doksani. Edited by Xhevahir Lleshi. 203p.\n\nAccording to Albanian online reviews, this collection contains texts by Stefan Zweig about Alexander Moissi. Therefore, one might suppose that Zweig's three articles which were published together in Das Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens. Essays (Frankfurt am Main: S. Fischer Verlag, 1984) are included in this volume",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
