      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Nón, Stefan Zweig, týska valið, og Heja Sverige. Hvør var Stefan Zweig og hvat eyðkendi skaldsskap hansara? Og hvat eyðkennir Týskland í dag og valið komandi sunnudag?\" [Three O'Clock in the Afternoon: Stefan Zweig, the German Elections, and 'Hello Sweden'. Who Was Stefan Zweig and What Characterized His Literature? And What Characterizes Germany Today and the Elections Next Sunday?], in: Nón: mentan og samfelag [Three O'Clock in the Afternoon: Culture and Society] [Tórshavn] [22 September 2017], 1 hour, 48 minutes and 20 seconds\n\n\"Nón: mentan og samfelag\" [Three O'Clock in the Afternoon: Culture and Society] is a news magazine broadcasted by the \"Kringvarp Føroya (KVF)\", the \"Faroese Broadcasting Corporation\", headquartered in Tórshavn, the capital of the Faeroe Islands\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://kringvarp.fo/non?sid=72504&page=1",
