      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Zweig endar Filmsdagarnar\" [Stefan Zweig in the Film Days] in portal.fo [Hvannasund], 24 September 2017\n\nportal.fo is a Faeroese news portal headquartered in Hvannasund, a village and municipality on the island of Viðoy, one of the Faeroe Islands\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://portal.fo/stefan+zweig+endar+filmsdagarnar.html\n\nThis is a review of both the German-French-Austrian movie Vor der Morgenröte - Stefan Zweig in Amerika [2016], which was directed by Maria Schrader, and of Knút Olsen's Faeroese translation Heimurin, ið var: endurminningar hjá einum evropeara [Vestmanna: Sprotin, 2017] of ''Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers\"",
