      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Ungeduld des Herzens in Yiddish. Manuscript and typescript of the play. Dramatized and translated by Joseph Buloff - various drafts, uncollated, unfinished and unproduced. The pages are all unnumbered - some typed on a typewriter, some handwritten in pencil or pen. There is no Yiddish title on any of the pages. Located in the Jewish Theatre Archive, Harvard University, Cambridge, MA",
      "sourceBlobId": 6
