      },
      "locationCreated": {
        "@id": "klawiter:place/Kafr%20El%20Sheikh%2C%20Egypt",
        "@type": "schema:Place",
        "name": "Kafr El Sheikh, Egypt"
      },
      "inLanguage": "ar",
      "languageName": "Arabic",
      "categories": [
        "Secondary Literature / Authors (Arabic)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Battānah Niyūz - jadīd Dār al-Khān.. thalāth tarjamāt li-Amānī Lāzār\" [Battana News - New Publications by Dār al-Khān: Three Translations by Amānī Lāzār], in: Battānah [Battana] [Kafr El Sheikh, Egypt], 17 October 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.battana.org/news-details.aspx?Q=30764&C=1\n\nThis is an announcement of the recent translation of two of Stefan Zweig's novellas, \"Brief einer Unbekannten\" and \"Phantastische Nacht\", by the Syrian translator Amānī Lāzār. The translation of \"Brief einer Unbekannten\" is the latest of several Arabic retranslations this novella has seen during the last decades. Both translations are published by a newcomer in the Arabic publishing field, the Kuwaiti publishing house Dār al-Khān:\n\n[1]. \"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" [Brief einer Unbekannten]. Translated by Amānī Lāzār. Edited by Muḥammad Sālim. Kuwait: Dār al-Khān li-l-Tarjamah waʾl-Nashr, 2017\n\n[2]. \"Laylah sāḥirah\" [Phantastische Nacht. Erzählungen]. Translated by Amānī Lāzār. Edited by Muḥammad Sālim. Kuwait: Dār al-Khān li-l-Tarjamah waʾl-Nashr, 2017",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
    {
