        "@value": "\"Tâyt-sà-gaan pâap-pá-yon: Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" [Film Festival - Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe] in Goethe Institut Thailand [Bangkok], [2017?]",
        "@language": "th"
      },
