      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Tâyt-sà-gaan pâap-pá-yon: Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" [Film Festival - Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe] in Goethe Institut Thailand [Bangkok], [2017?]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.goethe.de/ins/th/th/ver.cfm?fuseaction=events.detail&event_id=20870200\n\nThis is a screening announcement of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz. The film was being screened (with Thai and English subtitles) on the 24th of January 2017 at 7:30 PM in a film festival organized by the Goethe-Institut Thailand, the local branch in Bangkok of the German Cultural Institute.",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
