      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Daʿwah ʿāmmah li-ḥuḍūr al-film al-amrīkī .. Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" [Open Invitation to the American Movie \"Letter from an Unkown Woman\"] in Al-Muntadā al-Tanwīrī al-Thaqāfī al-Filasṭīnī - Tanwīr [Enlightenment - The Palestinian Forum for Cultural Enlightenment] [Nablus], 28 October 2011\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://www.tanwer.org/tanwer/news/1538.html\n\nThis is a screening announcement of the American film \"Letter from an Unknown Woman\" (1948), directed by Max Ophüls, screenplay adaptation by Howard Koch, and starring Joan Fontaine, Louis Jourdan, Mady Christians and Marcel Journet. The film (in Arabic translation) was being screened on the 31st of October 2011 at 4:00 PM in the precinct of the \"Al-Muntadā al-Tanwīrī al-Thaqāfī al-Filasṭīnī (Tanwīr)\" [Enlightenment - The Palestinian Forum for Cultural Enlightenment] in Nablus.",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
