      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Kuttāb wa-riwāʾiyyīn [sic] anhaw qiṣṣatahum muntaḥirīn\" [Authors and Novelists Who Brought Their Story to an End by Suicide] in Arājīk [AraGeek (Arab Eccentrics)] [USA], 10 September 2014 [updated: 09 October 2015]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.arageek.com/2014/09/10/10-novelists-and-writers-dead-suicide.html",
