      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Në luftë me djallin (Parathënia e librit \"Në luftë me djallin\")\" [The Struggle with the Daemon (Preface to the Book 'The Struggle with the Daemon')] in Zëri I popullit [Voice of the People] [Tiranë/Tirana], No. 12 [6 July 2003], pp. 6-7 (Supplement \"abc\")\n\nThis is the Albanian translation of Stefan Zweig's \"Vorwort [Stefan Zweig, Salzburg 1925]\" in Der Kampf mit dem Dämon: Hölderlin - Kleist - Nietzsche [Baumeister der Welt. Versuch einer Typologie des Geistes. Band 2]. 321/(3)p., Leipzig: Insel-Verlag, 1925, pp. 7-(22)",
