      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Letra e lamtumirës së Stefan Zweig dhe fundi i trishtë i shkrimtarit dhe bashkëshortes së tij\" [Stefan Zweig's Farewell Letter and the Sad Ending Which Its Author and His Wife Encountered] in Albert Vataj [Tirane/Tirana], 22 February 2017\n\n\"Albert Vataj\" is a blog by the Albanian writer Albert Vataj, hosted on the web platform , which is headquartered in Tiranë/Tirana, Albania\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://albertvataj.com/2017/02/gjithcka-per-vetevrasjen-e-stefan-zweig-dhe-bashkeshortes-se-tij-charlotte/\n\n[2]. \"Robert Shvarc, i paepuri i vlerave njerëzore, ngadhënjyesi i shqipes në ligjërimin e kolosëve të letërsisë botërore\" [Robert Shvarc, Uncompromising about Human Values, the Leader of the Albanian Language among the Voices of World Literature's Giants] in Albert Vataj [Tiranë/Tirana], 25 April 2018\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://albertvataj.com/2018/04/robert-shvarc-i-paepuri-i-vlerave-njerezore-ngadhenjyesi-i-shqipes-ne-ligjerimin-e-koloseve-te-letersise-boterore/\n\nThis is a CV of Robert Shvarc, one of the most prolific Albanian translators of Stefan Zweig's works",
