      "mainCategory": "Historical Studies",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Cvajg – Vjena – Bota e djeshme – Kujtime të një evropiani \" [Stefan Zweig - Vienna - \"The World of Yesterday. Memoirs of a European\"]. Translated by Aristidh Ristani. Edited by Gazmend Krasniqi in Palimpsest. Revistë kulturore-letrare online [Palimpsest. Cultural and Literary Online Magazine] [Tirana], 19 December 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://palimpsest.al/2017/12/19/stefan-cvajg-vjena-bota-e-djeshme-kujtime-te-nje-evropiani/\n\nThis is an extract from Aristidh Ristani's Albanian translation Bota e djeshme. Kujtime të një evropiani of Stefan Zweig's autobiography Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers. The complete extract is taken from the chapter \"Die Welt der Sicherheit\"",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
