      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Riwāyatān qaṣīratān l-Stīfān Zfāygh\" [Two Short Novels by Stefan Zweig] in ultraṣawt [s.l.], 4 October 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.ultrasawt.com/%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%AA%D8%A7%D9%86-%D9%82%D8%B5%D9%8A%D8%B1%D8%AA%D8%A7%D9%86-%D9%84%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B2%D9%81%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%BA/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AA%D8%B1%D8%A7-%D8%B5%D9%88%D8%AA/%D9%86%D8%B4%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%AB%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%81%D9%8A%D8%A9/%D8%AB%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%A9\n\nIn this article two recent translations by Amānī Lāzār are reviewed: [1] \"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" [Brief einer Unbekannten]. Translated by Amānī Lāzār. Edited by Muḥammad Sālim. ??p. Kuwait: Dār al-Khān li-l-Tarjamah waʾl-Nashr, 2017, and [2] \"Laylah sāḥirah\" [Phantastische Nacht. Erzählungen]. Translated by Amānī Lāzār. Edited by Muḥammad Sālim. ??p. Kuwait: Dār al-Khān li-l-Tarjamah waʾl-Nashr, 2017",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
