      "name": {
        "@value": "\"\"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" ... nihāyat ḥubb min ṭaraf wāḥid\" [\"Letter from an Unknown Woman\"... The End of Love from One Side] in Al-Fann / Elfann [The Art] [Lebanon], 12 June 2012",
