      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"\"Risālah min imraʾah majhūlah\" ... nihāyat ḥubb min ṭaraf wāḥid\" [\"Letter from an Unknown Woman\"... The End of Love from One Side] in Al-Fann / Elfann [The Art] [Lebanon], 12 June 2012\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.elfann.com/news/show/1017920/%D8%B1%D8%B3%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%85%D8%B1%D8%A3%D8%A9-%D9%85%D8%AC%D9%87%D9%88%D9%84%D8%A9-...-%D9%86%D9%87%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%B7%D8%B1%D9%81-%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%AD%D8%AF\n\nThis is a theater review of the play \"Lettre d'une inconnue\" [Brief einer Unbekannten], directed by Christophe Lindon, starring Sarah Biasini and Thomas Cousseau, and staged at the Théâtre Monnot in Bairut on 08 June 2012. The play in the French language was originally produced for the Théâtre des Mathurins in Paris",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
