      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"\"Stīfān Zfāyj, wadāʿan li-Ūrūbā: insān bilā waṭan huwa insān bilā mustaqbal\" [\"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\": Someone without a Homeland Is like Someone without a Future] in Nūn būst [\"Noon\" Post] [Doha?], 13 December 2017\n\nNūn būst [\"Noon\" Post] is a news forum which pretends to be pan-Arab\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://www.noonpost.org/content/21148\n\nThis is a film review of the English version \"Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe\" of the German-French-Austrian movie \"Vor der Morgenröte\" (2016), directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
