      "mainCategory": "Historical Studies",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Fouche mbi revolucionin popullor!\" [Fouché on the People's Revolution. Edited by Shkumbin Nebihi] in filozofia.al [Philosophy.al] [Los Angeles, CA], 01 July 2017\n\nfilozofia.al [Philosophy.al] is an Albanian web portal dedicated to philosophy, whose server is located in Los Angeles, CA\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://filozofia.al/index.php/2017/07/01/fouche-mbi-revolucionin-popullor/\n\nThis is an extract from the Albanian translation \"Zhozef Fushe\" of Stefan Zweig's biography \"Joseph Fouché. Bildnis eines politischen Menschen\". The editor Shkumbin Nebihi does not indicate from which of the two Albanian translations the extract was taken.\n\nhttp://zweig.fredonia.edu/index.php?title=Zhozef_Fushe_:_portret_i_nj%C3%AB_njeriu_politik",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
