      "mainCategory": "Historical Studies",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Stefan Cvajg – Në studion e Rodenit\" [Stefan Zweig - In Rodin's Studio. Although not indicated, the translator is Aristidh Ristani] in Palimpsest. Revistë kulturore-letrare online [Palimpsest. Cultural and Literary Online Magazine] [Tirana], 05 December 2017\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://palimpsest.al/2017/12/05/stefan-cvajg-ne-studion-e-rodenit/\n\nThis is an extract from Aristidh Ristani's Albanian translation Bota e djeshme. Kujtime të një evropiani [Die Welt von Gestern. Erinnerungen eines Europäers]. The complete extract is taken from the chapter \"Paris, die Stadt der ewigen Jugend\"",
