      "bibliographicCitation": "\"“Tanikhgüi emegtein zakhidal” (Letter from an Unknown women [sic]) nomyn temdeglel [\"Letter from an Unknown Woman\" - Notes on Books]\" in Medium [San Francisco, CA], 12 April 2018\n\nMedium is an online publishing platform and a blog host owned by A Medium Corporation, the headquarter of which is in San Francisco, CA\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://medium.com/@turtogtokherdenebaatar/%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%85%D0%B3%D2%AF%D0%B9-%D1%8D%D0%BC%D1%8D%D0%B3%D1%82%D1%8D%D0%B9%D0%BD-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%85%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BB-letter-from-an-unknown-women-%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%8B%D0%BD-%D1%82%D1%8D%D0%BC%D0%B4%D1%8D%D0%B3%D0%BB%D1%8D%D0%BB-f8549fa9834f\n\nThis is a review of either the Mongolian translation \"Tanikhgüi emegtein zakhidal\" or the English translation \"Letter from an Unknown Woman\" of \"Brief einer Unbekannten\". The reviewer does not give further details on the exact translation or edition",
