      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Matumitā / Madhumitha [b. Svapṉā Māturi (Swapna Madhuri)], \"Rāja viḷaiyāṭṭu - Latā Rāmakiruṣṇaṉ\" [The Royal Game - Lata Ramakrishnan] in madhumithaa.blogspot [Mountain View, CA], 11 June 2012 [posted 23 July 2012]\n\nmadhumithaa.blogspot is a blog by the Indian actress Madhumitha (b. Swapna Madhuri), starring in Telugu and Tamil film productions. The blog is hosted by the blog host \"Blogger\", Mountain View, CA\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://madhumithaa.blogspot.com/2012/07/blog-post_23.html\n\nThis is a review of the Tamil translation:\n\nRāja viḷaiyāṭṭu: Jermāṉiyak kuṟunāval [Schachnovelle]. Translated by Latā Rāmakiruṣṇaṉ [Latha Ramakrishnan]. 136p. Chennai: Putuppuṉal [Pudhupunal], 2012",
