      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Bōrakara, Bāḷakr̥ṣṇa Bhagavanta: (30 Nōvhēmbara 1910 — )\" [Borkar, Balkrishna Bhagwant: (30 November 1910 -)] in Marāṭhī viśvakōśa [Marathi Encyclopedia] [Mumbai], [s.a.]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://marathivishwakosh.maharashtra.gov.in/khandas/khand11/?id=10732\n\nThis is an article about the life and works of Balkrishna Bhagwant Borkar [Baḷkṛṣṇa Bhagvant Borkar], the author and literary translator who translated Stefan Zweig's \"Brennendes Geheimnis\" into Marathi:\n\nJaḷatē rahasya [Brennendes Geheimnis]. Translated by Baḷkṛṣṇa Bhagvant Borkar [Balkrishna Bhagwant Borkar]. viii/103p. Kolhāpūra [Kolhapur]: Dāmodara Nārāyaṇa Moghe, 1945. Later edition: 76p. Sōlāpūra [Solapur]: Suvidyā prakāśana [Suvidya Publications], 2001",
