      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Fantastic night and other stories – Stefan Zweig\" in Pustakaṁ.Neṭ [About Books.Net] [San Francisco, CA], 18 September 2017\n\nPustakaṁ.Neṭ / Pustakam.net [About Books.Net] is a Telugu web magazine dedicated to commentaries on world literature primarily in Telugu and occasionally in English and based on the blogging platform \"WordPress.com\" [San Francisco, CA]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttp://pustakam.net/?p=19847\n\nThis is a review of Fantastic Night and Other Stories [London: Pushkin Press, 2004], a collection of five novellas, translated into English by Anthea Bell and Eden and Cedar Bell. 164/(3)p.",
