      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Das Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens\" [This is the German version of a lecture delivered in America in January and February 1939 under the title \"Mortal Beings and Immortal Art\"]\n\nPrinted in:\n\nEssays. Auswahl 1929-1942 [Leipzig, 1990], No. 16, pp. 443-463\n\nDas Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens [Frankfurt am Main, 1981/1988], No. 20, pp. 227-(250) [Fischer Taschenbuch, 2288]\n\nDas Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens. Essays [Frankfurt am Main, 1984/2007], No. 33, pp. 348-(371)\n\nSinn und Schönheit der Autographen [Wien/Leipzig/Zürich, 1935], No. 2\n\nDie Stefan Zweig Box [Berlin, 2006]. 6 CDs. No. 9. CD 6. Tracks 3-8\n\nStefan Zweig. Gesammelte Werke in Einzelbänden [Frankfurt am Main, 1981-1991], No. 17 [1984]\n\nStefan Zweig. Das große Lesebuch [Frankfurt am Main, 2005/2008], No. 14, pp. 124-143\n\nWort und Tat. Internationale Monatsschrift [Innsbruck/Wien/Paris], 2:9 [September 1948], pp. 7-21\n\nZeit und Welt [Frankfurt am Main, 1981/1982], No. 20, pp. 165-181\n\nZeit und Welt. Gesammelte Aufsätze und Vorträge 1904-1940 [Stockholm, 1943/1946], No. 17, pp. (269)-296; [1946], No. 17, pp. (249)-274\n\nTranslations:\n\nChinese: \"Yishu chuangzuo de mimi\" in [1]. Ciweige sanwen jingxuan [Beijing, 1997], No. 17, pp. 159-180. [2]. Ciweige wenji [Taiyuan/Xi'an, 1998], Vol. 6, No. 2, pp. 1-20\n\nEnglish: \"The Secret of Artistic Creation\" in Messages from a Lost World [London, 2016], No. 16, pp. (135)-158\n\nFrench: \"Le Secret de la création artistique\" in [1]. Derniers messages [Paris/Neuchâtel, 1949], No. 5, pp. (83)-105. [2]. Derniers messages [Paris, 2013], No. 6, pp. (103)-127. [3]. \"Le mystère de la creatión artistique\" in Essais [Paris 1996/2006], No. 5, pp. ??\n\nGreek: [1]. To mystiko tēs kallitechnikēs dēmiourgias [Athēna, 1949], No. 1, pp. ??. [2]. \"To mystērio tēs kallitechnikēs dēmiourgias\" in To mystērio tēs kallitechnikēs dēmiourgias [Athēna, 2002], No. 2, pp. (13)-69. [3]. To mystērio tēs k