    {
      "@type": [
        "schema:Movie",
        "klawiter:FilmEntry"
      ],
      "@id": "klawiter:entry/6307",
      "entryType": "film",
      "sourcePageId": 6307,
      "pageNamespace": 0,
      "name": "Sternstunden der Menschheit",
      "sourceTextId": 44926,
      "author": {
        "@id": "http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q78491",
        "@type": "schema:Person",
        "name": "Stefan Zweig"
      },
      "datePublished": "2010",
      "timePeriod": "contemporary",
      "locationCreated": {
        "@id": "klawiter:place/Hannover",
        "@type": "schema:Place",
        "name": "Hannover"
      },
      "categories": [
        "Films / Plays / Operas"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Films",
      "bibliographicCitation": "[2010]: Cumberlandsche Bühne, Staatstheater, Hannover\n\nSternstunden der Menschheit. A theatrical adaptation by Soeren Voima. Stage direction by Christian Tschirner. Scenery by Aljoscha Begrich. Costumes by Esther Krapiwnikow. Music by Martin Vischer.\n\nEach of the actors reported the fate of the main character in the first person:\n\nSusana Fernandes Genebra [Cicero]\nJanko Kahle [Lenin / Der versiegelte Zug]\nChristoph Müller [Johann August Suter / Die Entdeckung Eldorados]\nOscar Olivo [Dostojewski / Heroischer Augenblick]\nJulia Schmalbrock [Robert Falcan Scott / Der Kampf um den Südpol]\nMartin Vischer [Die Eroberung von Byzanz]\n\nPremiere:\n\n8 May 2010 in the Cumberlandsche Bühne, Staatstheater, Hannover. The play was repeated on 14 and 23 May as well as on 3, 15, 20 and 24 June\n\nReview:\n\nRonald Meyer-Arlt. \"Spiel: Geschichte. Stefan Zweigs 'Sternstunden der Menschheit' auf der Cumberlandschen Bühne uraufgeführt\" in Hannoversche Allgemeine Zeitung [Hannover], 10 May 2010. The review contains a photograph of Susana Fernandes Genebra and the four male actors but for some reason Julia Schmalbrock was omitted",
      "sourceBlobId": 4
    },
