      "bibliographicCitation": "[1910-1913]: Insel-Verlag, Leipzig\n\nAusgewählte Romane und Novellen. 12 vols. Revised and edited from earlier translations by Leo Feld and Erwin Krauss. Foreword by Stefan Zweig. Illustrated by Phiz [i.e. Hablôt Knight Browne] et al. Title page and cover design by E. R. Weiss. Stefan Zweig's foreword \"Charles Dickens\", Vol. 1 [1910], pp. v-xxx. Of the 12-volume Library Edition, 200 copies were printed on cotton paper, numbered and bound in leather. The 12-volume set was not reprinted\n\nA 6-volume edition printed on India paper was also printed. Leipzig: Insel-Verlag, 1910-1913. Stefan Zweig's foreword \"Charles Dickens\", Vol. 1 [1910], pp. v-xxx\n\nEditions:\n\n*1st edition. Vol. 1. 5,000 copies. 1910\n*2nd edition. Vol. 1. 5,000 copies. 1913\n*3rd edition. Vol. 1. 4,000 copies. 1921\n*4th edition. Vol. 1. 4,000 copies. 1923\n*5th edition. Vol. 1. 4,000 copies. 1926",
