      "bibliographicCitation": "[2016]: Ādhāra Prakāśana [Aadhar Prakashan Pvt. Ltd.], Pañcakūlā [Panchkula]\n\nAntaryatrayen : vaaya Viyana [Intervals: via Vienna]. 1st edition. 176p.\n\nSee the ad by an Indian online bookshop:\n\nhttp://www.hindibook.com/index.php?p=sr&Uc=HB-407887\n\nThe book contains Omā Śarmā's [Oma Sharma's] travel diaries. In eight essays, he \nrecounts his travel experiences in India and Europe, inter alia, an \nextensive essay (ca. 70p.) about Vienna and Austria as the cultural \nsetting of Stefan Zweig's œuvre.",
