      "name": "Musābaqah fī qirāʾat kitāb \"Mājillān. Qāhir al-biḥār\" [20 February 2010]",
      "sourceTextId": 48250,
      "datePublished": "2010",
      "timePeriod": "contemporary",
      "translator": {
