      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Quatro anos depois\" in Stefan Zweig. Die geistige Einheit der Welt [Rio de Janeiro, 2017], [VII]: Quatro anos depois, No. 1, pp. 171-172. Written in Brazilian Portuguese. The name of the author of this text is not indicated. On 29 October 1940, in Buenos Aires, Stefan Zweig repeated his lecture \"The Spiritual Unity of the World\" that he had given in Rio de Janeiro in August 1936. This time the text was in Spanish. See: Cuatro años después. The name of the author of this text is not indicated",
      "sourceBlobId": 5
    },
