      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Cuatro años después\" in Stefan Zweig. Die geistige Einheit der Welt [Rio de Janeiro, 2017], [VII]: Quatro anos depois, No. 2, pp. 172-174. Translated from Brazilian Portuguese into Spanish by Ana María Pomí. The name of the author of this text is not indicated. On 29 October 1940, in Buenos Aires, Stefan Zweig repeated his lecture \"The Spiritual Unity of the World\" that he had given in Rio de Janeiro in August 1936. This time the text was in Spanish, translated from the German original by Alfredo Cahn.\n\nReprinted in:\n\nCursos y Conferencias. Revsita del Colegio Libre de Estudios Superiores [Buenos Aires], Year X:No 10, Vol. XX [January 1942], pp. 1033-1045\nStefan Zweig. Los creadores. Translated by Alfredo Cahn. Buenos Aires: Editorial Tor, 1942, pp. 75-124",
