      "bibliographicCitation": "[1]. \"Rundfrage über Karl Kraus\" in Der Brenner [Innsbruck], 3:18 [15 June 1913], pp. 835-852. Stefan Zweig's response, pp. 850-851\n\n[2]. The three parts of this questionnaire were published in book form as Rundfrage über Karl Kraus. Edited by Ludwig von Ficker. 43p. Innsbruck: Brenner-Verlag, 1917, Stefan Zweig's response, pp. 38-39. Ludwig von Ficker's \"Nachwort\", pp. 40-43\n\n[3]. Excerpt in Ludwig von Ficker. Denkzettel und Danksagungen: Aufsätze - Reden. Edited by Franz Seyr. München: Kösel Verlag, 1967, pp. 325-326\n\n[4]. Karl Kraus's response to Stefan Zweig's comments: \"(Rundfrage über Karl Kraus)\" in Die Fackel [Wien], 15:391/392 [21 January 1914], pp. 24-27",
