        "Secondary Literature / Authors (Norwegian)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Secondary Literature",
      "bibliographicCitation": "Norwegian/Bokmål\n\n\"\"Farewell to Europe\" (Regissør: Maria Schrader). En film om Stefan Zweigs siste år i eksil\" [\"Farewell to Europe\" (film director: Maria Schrader). A Movie about Stefan Zweig's Last Year in Exile] in Rose-Maries litteratur- og filmblogg [Rose-Marie's literature and movie blog] [Mountain View, CA], 27 December 2017\n\nRose-Maries litteratur- og filmblogg [Rose-Marie's literature and movie blog] is a blog by Rose-Marie Christiansen, jurist and director of the Nasjonalt klageorgan for helsetjenesten, the Norwegian National Complaints Body for the Health Service. The blog is hosted by the blog host Blogger [Mountain View, CA]\n\nPublished online:\n\nhttps://rosemariechr.blogspot.com/2017/12/farewell-to-europe-regissr-maria.html\n\nThis is a review of the German, French, and Austrian movie Vor der Morgenröte - Stefan Zweig in Amerika [2016], directed by Maria Schrader, script by Maria Schrader and Jan Schomburg, and starring Josef Hader, Barbara Sukowa, and Aenne Schwarz",
      "sourceBlobId": 5
    },
