      "mainCategory": "Essays",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"'An Caliban'. Epilog zu Shakespeares Sturm\" in Der Wiener Tag [Wien], 8 December 1932, p. 14\n\n\"Prolog und Epilog zu Shakespeare's Sturm: Quasi una phantasia\" in Marsyas [Berlin], 2:4 [January/February 1918], pp. 77-79. Reprinted in Insel Almanach auf das Jahr 1926. Leipzig: Insel-Verlag, 1925, pp. 68-74 [A typescript with handwritten corrections was located in the Stefan Zweig Archives, London, England]\n\"Zu William Shakespeare (1564-1616): Prolog und Epilog zu Shakespeares Sturm: Quasi una phantasia\" in Zeitlose [Krems an der Donau, 2017], No. 8, pp. 47-53\n\nExcerpts: \n\n\"Shakespeare\" in Die Theaterwelt [Düsseldorf], 2:4 [16 October 1926], pp. 73-76 [This is an excerpt from Stefan Zweig's novella \"Verwirrung der Gefühle: Private Aufzeichnungen des Geheimrates R. v. D.\"]. Reprinted in: Freie Tribüne [Paris], No. 20 [Spielzeit 1927/1928], pp. 173-175",
      "sourceBlobId": 5
