      "mainCategory": "Correspondence",
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Unbekannte Briefe an den Verlag Wremja, Leningrad\" in Neue Deutsche Literatur [Deutscher Schriftstellerverband, Berlin], 26:12 [December 1978], pp. 99-120. These pages contain 18 letters by Stefan Zweig to the Verlag Wremja, 30 December 1925 to 26 July 1934, and 7 various photographs [pp. 102 105, 107, 111, 113, 115, 119. The photograph on p. 102 is the cover of Der Zwang. Eine Novelle; p. 107 is the last paragraph of the letter of 15 December; p. 119 is a photograph of the portrait of Stefan Zweig by Frans Masereel] \n\nLetters:\n\n30 December 1925, p. 99\n20 March 1926, p. 100\n10 May 1926, pp. 100-101\n8 November 1926, pp. 101, 103-104\n22 November 1926, p. 104\n15 December 1926, pp. 104, 106, 108\n30 December 1926, pp. 108-109\n29 April 1927, pp. 109-110\n11 March 1927, p. 110\n26 September 1927, pp. 110, 112, , 114\n31 January 1928, p. 114\n1 September 1928, p. 114\n1 December 1928, p. 116\n1 March 1929, p. 117\n11 December 1929, pp. 117-118\n16 November 1931, p. 118\n4 January 1933, pp. 119-120\n26 July 1934, p. 120",
