        "Paroles d'un Européen [Toulose/Paris, 2018], No. XXV, pp. 143-(161). Pages 141-(142) contain an explanatory discussion of Stefan Zweig's lecture \"La Vienne d'hier\" delivered in the Théâtre Marigny in Paris on 26 April 1940. It contains a lot of information about when and where it was first announced and who made commentaries about it"
