      "workTranslation": [
        "Croatian: (Serbo-Croatian). \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in Pismo nepoznate žene i druge novele [Zagreb, 1952], No. 8, pp. 257-316"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "\"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin\" in Neue Freie Presse [Wien], 7 November 1918, pp. (1)-2 [\"Die verlorene Kindheit]; 9 November 1918, pp. (1)-2 [\"Die Schauspielerin\"]\n\nEntire version: See: Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin\n\nMarceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin. Foreword by Stefan Zweig. Translation of Desbordes-Valmore's poems by Gisela Etzel-Kühn. Cover design by F. H. Ehmcke. 349.(2)p. Illustrated, Leipzig: Insel-Verlag, 1920. Stefan Zweig's foreword, pp. 5-68. Afterword by Stefan Zweig, p. 349\n\nMarceline Desbordes-Valmore. Das Lebensbild einer Dichterin. Revised and Expander edition. Foreword by Stefan Zweig [The foreword was expanded by the chapter \"Menschlichkeit\"]. Translation of Desbordes-Valmore's poems by Gisela Etzel-Kühn and Friderike Maria Zweig. Portraits, a sketch and a medallion by Constant Desbordes, Hilaire Ledru and David d'Angers. 261/(1)p. Leipzig: Insel-Verlag, 1927. Stefan Zweig's foreword, pp. (5)-82 [\"Bildnis ihres Schicksals\"]. Afterword by Stefan Zweig, p. 260\n\nFinal version reprinted in:\n\nBegegnungen mit Menschen, Büchern, Städten [Wien/Leipzig/Zürich, 1937], No. 33, pp. (335)-395; [Frankfurt am Main, 1955/1956], No. 33, pp. 318-372 [Gesammelte Werke in Einzelbänden]\nEssays. Auswahl 1907-1924 [Leipzig, 1983], No. 38, pp. 276-335 [Gesammelte Werke in Einzelbänden]\nDas Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens [Frankfurt am Main, 1981/1988], No. 13, pp. 97-165\nDas Geheimnis des künstlerischen Schaffens. Essays [Frankfurt am Main, 1984/2007], No. 8, pp. 83-(162) [Gesammelte Werke in Einzelbänden]\n\nExcerpts:\n\n\"Die Dichterin Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in Das literarische Echo [Berlin], 22:4 [15 November 1919], cols. 209-214 [\"Die Dichterin\"]\n\"Menschlichkeit\" in Das Inselschiff [Leipzig], 8:4 [Herbst/Autumn 1927], pp. 282-285\n\nTranslations:\n\nCroatian: (Serbo-Croatian). \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in Pismo nepoznate žene i druge novele [Zagreb, 1952], No. 8, pp. 257-316\n\nFrench: \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in Souvenirs et rencontres [Paris, 1951 and 1997]: [1951], No. 14, pp. (189)-268; [1997], No. 15, pp. (173)-242 // Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. Translated by Alzir Hella and Olivier Bouranc. 79p. Paris: La Nouvelle revue critique, 2004 [Collectión critique 1, Series 2]\n\nGreek: \"Marselina Debord-Valmor\" in Anamnēseis kai synantēseis [Athēna, 19556], No. 13, pp. 145-191\n\nHungarian: \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. Egg költönö élete\" in Örök tüzek [Budapest, 1946], No. 2, pp. 15-78\n\nItalian: \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in Incontri e amicizie [Milano/Verona, 1950], No. 7, pp. 107-178\n\nPortuguese: \"Marcelina Desbordes-Valmore\" in [1]. Encontros com homens, livros e países [Rio de Janeiro, 1939], No. 29, pp. 291-343. [2]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1934-1950 [Rio de Janeiro, 1934-1950], Vol. 10, No. 33, pp. (289)-340. [3]. Obras completas de Stefan Zweig, 1960 [Rio de Janeiro, 1960], Vol. 10, No. 32, pp. (289)-340 // \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore\" in [4]. Encontros [Porto, 1960], Vol. III, No. 2, pp. 21-116. // \"Marceline Desbordes-Valmore. A história da vida de uma poetisa\" in [5]. Obras de Stefan Zweig, 1934-1950, [Porto, 1934-1950], Vol. 14, No. 2, pp. (21)-115\n\nRussian: \"Marselina Debord-Val'mor\" in [1]. Izbrannye proizvedeniia v dvukh tomakh [Moskva, 1956], Vol. 2, No. 4, pp. 103-(150) [See: (Esse) // \"Marselina Debord-Val'mor. Sud'ba poetessy\" in [2]. Sobranie sochinenii Stefana Tsveiga v desiati tomakh [Moskva, 1992-1993], Vol. 7, No. 1, pp. (5)-(166). [3]. Sobranie sochinenii Stefana Tsveiga v dvenadtsati tomakh [Leningrad, 1927-1932], Vol. 8, No. 1, pp. (5)-(82) // \"Marselina Debord-Val'mor. Zhizn' poetessy\" in [4]. Sobranie sochinenii Stefana Tsveiga v deviati tomakh [Moskva, 1996-1997], Vol. 7, No. 6, pp. 427-(556). [5]. Sobranie sochinenii Stefana Tsveiga v semi tomakh [Moskva, 1963], Vol. 6, No. 5, pp. (367)-(434)\n\nSpanish: \"Marcelina Desbordes-Valmore. La biografía de una poetisa\" in [1]. Hombres, libros y ciudades [Barcelona, 1963], No. 33, pp. (289)-341 // \"Marcelina Desbordes-Valmore, nuestra señora de las lágrimas\" in [2]. La pasión creadora [Ciudad de México 1994], No. 2, pp. 15-69. [3]. La pasión creadora. Artistas, poetas, novelistas y críticos [Buenos Aires, 1941], No. 1, pp. (5)-70 // \"La tragedia de una vida\" in Obras completas de Stefan Zweig [Barcelona, 1952-1978], Vol. 3, No. 42, pp. (773)-840\n\n(Esse)",
