    {
      "@type": [
        "schema:CreativeWork",
        "klawiter:CorrespondenceEntry"
      ],
      "@id": "klawiter:entry/7624",
      "entryType": "correspondence",
      "sourcePageId": 7624,
      "pageNamespace": 0,
      "name": {
        "@value": "Stefan Zweig und Ellen Key. Eine biografische Miniatur",
        "@language": "de"
      },
      "originalTitle": "1",
      "sourceTextId": 61677,
      "author": {
        "@id": "http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q78491",
        "@type": "schema:Person",
        "name": "Stefan Zweig"
      },
      "datePublished": "2020",
      "allYears": [
        1819,
        1903,
        1904,
        1905,
        1906,
        1907,
        1908,
        1909,
        1910,
        1911,
        1915,
        1916,
        1917,
        1918,
        1919,
        1921,
        2020
      ],
      "timePeriod": "contemporary",
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "klawiter:publisher/Peter%20Lang%20GmbH",
        "@type": "schema:Organization",
        "name": "Peter Lang GmbH"
      },
      "locationCreated": {
        "@id": "klawiter:place/Berlin",
        "@type": "schema:Place",
        "name": "Berlin",
        "sameAs": "http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q64"
      },
      "allLocations": [
        "Berlin",
        "Wien",
        "Paris",
        "London",
        "Roma",
        "Salzburg"
      ],
      "inLanguage": "de",
      "languageName": "German",
      "numberOfPages": 145,
      "categories": [
        "Correspondence / Volumes (German)"
      ],
      "mainCategory": "Correspondence",
      "hasPart": [
        "[1]. Vorwort, pp. (7)-9"
      ],
      "bibliographicCitation": "[2020]: Peter Lang GmbH, Berlin\n\nStefan Zweig und Ellen Key. Eine biografische Miniatur. Briefwechsel zwischen einem jungen österreichischen Dichter und einer schwedischen Philosophin und Gesellschaftsreformerin. Edited with a foreword and biographical information by Margrit Hansen. 145p. Illustrated. Cover illustrations: Photograph of Ellen Key, ca. 1906; portrait photograph of Stefan Zweig ca, 1903/1904.\n\nContents:\n\n[1]. Vorwort, pp. (7)-9\n\n[2]. Muttersprache - Heimatland. Curriculum vitae der beiden Briefpartner: Stefan Zweig, pp. (11)-13. Ellen Key, pp. 14-16\n\n[3]. Schriftliche Kommunikation: Stefan Zweig an Ellen Key und Ellen Key an Stefan Zweig. [1]. Biografische Anmerkungen, pp. (17)-18. [2]. Entwicklung der Kommunikation in ihrer Zeit, pp. 19-30 \n\n[4]. Die Briefe. [1], Briefwechsel von 1904-1911, pp. (31)-88. [2]. Briefwechsel von 1915-1921, pp. 90-110. See: Die Briefe below \n\n[5]. Eine Wahlverwandschaft. [1]. Kulturelle Begegnung, pp. 111-116. [2]. Am Anfang ist das Wort, pp. 117-122. [3]. Heimat und Entwurzelung, pp. 123 -131\n\n[6]. Abbildungen, p, (135) \n\n[7]. Auswahlbibliographie. [1] Quellen, p. (137). [2]. In deutscher Sprache erschienene Werke Keys, pp. (137)-139. [3]. Zu Keys Lebzeiten in deutscher Sprache erschienene Werke Zweigs, pp. 139-140. [4]. Weitere Werke, pp. 140-142\n\n[8]. Erwähnte Personen, pp. (143)-145\n\nDie Briefe/Correspondence:\n\n1. Zweig to Key, a letter, Wien 1904, p. (31)\n\n2. Key to Zweig, a letter, Småland, 3 November 1904, pp. 32-33\n\n3. Zweig to Key, a letter, Paris [November/December 1904], pp. 33\n\n4. Key to Zweig, a letter, Småland, 25. Dezember 1904, p. 34\n\n5. Zweig to Key, a letter, Paris [1905], p. 36\n\n6. Key to Zweig, a card, no city indicated, [18 February 1905], p. 37\n\n7. Zweig to Key, a letter, Wien, 1 July [1905], pp. 37-38\n\n8. Key to Zweig, a letter, Ranstäter, 2 August 1905, pp. 38-39\n\n9. Zweig to Key, a letter, Tirano, 12 August 1905, pp. 40-43\n\n1